<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">MATEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">MATEO NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Né <char style="bd">Mateo</char> didɛ toɔ wɔ Kapernaum yeɛ Yesu frɛle ye kyɛ ɔɔboka ye asuafoɛ naso ɔ. Na mmerɛ bɔ Yesu ye y'asomafoɛ 12 ne, ɔfale ye bokale so. Afoɛ nza ne bue bɔ Yesu fa yɛle ye asɛnka adwuma ne, Mateo nwuni bɔ ɔhɔle so nanu pee. Ná ye yeɛ oli moa hworɔle Yesu asetena nu dwirɛ ɔ. Ɔhworɔle ye kɔyɛ afoɛ 41 Y.A <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire “Yesu Aberɛ so” (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> wɔ Israel. Na ye nzɛmba ne ka Yesu nwo dwirɛ fi ye nwonzɛen so wɔ afoɛ 2 K.Y.B<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">K.Y.B kyire “Kora yeɛ Yesu Ba Ɔ” (Brɔfo: Before Common Era anaa B.C.E)</char></note> kosi mmerɛ bɔ Yesu hɔle anwuro wɔ afoɛ 33 Y.A.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mateo nwomaa ne hyɛ yebo fi edwirɛ bɔ osisile kora yeɛ bɛbaawo Yesu, kosi Yesu dwirɛ bɔ ɔhane ye kyɛ “Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔɔyɛ maen mukoraati m'asuafoɛ” naso. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref></char>) Mateo nwomaa ne yeɛ oli moa wɔ Kristofoɛ Greek Tworɔnzɛm nanu ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mateo nzɛmba ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Kristofoɛ Tworɔnzɛm (Apam Foforɛ) ne, ɔne Hebri Tworɔnzɛm (Apam Daa) ne bɔ abusua;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu yeɛ ole Mezaya ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu yeɛ ole sona deinn bɔ odikyɛ odi Ɔhene David bia ɔ;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu yeɛ Nyameɛ hane ye nwo dwirɛ hyirele Abraham kyɛ, ye bosoniɛ kɔmaa aseɛ he so mmenia mukoraati konya nhyira ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Adwuma titire paa bɔ odikyɛ Kristofoɛ yɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛkɔha nzɛmba ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔ Mateo hworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ namukoraati hɔle so wɔ Palestina mandanu berɛ, ɔhyɛ yebo fi Kaesarea Filipi kodwu Bɛsheba. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Roman maen ne yeɛ ne odi tumi ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔ ɔhɔle so wɔ Yesu aworɛ nu ne yeɛ ɔfa hyɛle ye nzɛmba nabo ɔ, (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-3:17">Mat 1:18–3:17</ref></char>) sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Romanfoɛ ne aye Herode kyɛ ye yeɛ ɔnea Yuda maen naso ɔ. Na Yesu wue, ye tingyelɛ, ne mmerɛ bɔ ɔhɔle anwuro ne yɛ ɔfa yiele ɔ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">Mat 28:1-20</ref></char>) Sɔ mmerɛ ne koso, né Pontio Pilato, Antipa ne Filipo yeɛ ne bɛnea Yudea maen naso ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu aworɛ kodwu ye asubɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-3:17">1:18–3:17</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Abɔnzam sɔle Yesu neane; ɔhyɛle ye asɛnka adwuma nabo wɔ Galilea. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:1-25">4:1-25</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bokaa so asɛnka. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5:1–7:29</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu yɛle anwanwadeɛ pee wɔ Galilea. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:1-9:34">8:1–9:34</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu fale asɛnka adwuma nanwo akwankyerɛ mane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:35-11:1">9:35–11:1</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu hyinini Galilea mukoraati yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:2-12:50">11:2–12:50</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu fale mvandoho hane Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:1-58">13:1-58</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asɛnka adwuma né awieɛ wɔ Galilea ne ye mandanu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:1-18:35">14:1–18:35</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asɛnka adwuma wɔ Perea ne Yeriko mandanu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1–20:34</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asɛnka adwuma bɔ ɔpɛ yebo wɔ Yerusalem. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-23:39">21:1–23:39</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Awieɛ mmerɛ nanwo nzɛngyerɛneɛ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:1-25:46">24:1–25:46</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛyele Yesu bɛmane, onwuni amaneɛ, bɛhuni ye, bɛsiele ye. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:1-27:66">26:1–27:66</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛtingyele Yesu; ɔmane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ahyɛdeɛ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />David awa, Abraham awa Yesu Kristo nwo abakwasɛm nwomaa:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abraham wole Isaac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isaac wole Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yakob wole Yuda ne oliema mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda ne Tamar wole Peres ne Sera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Peres wole Hesron,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Hesron wole Ram.<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Ram wole Aminadab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadab wole Nason,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Nason wole Salmon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon ne Rahab wole Boas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boas ne Ruth wole Obed,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obed wole Yese.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese wole Ɔhene David,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:6">David ne Uria aye ne wole Solomon.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomon wole Rehoboam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehoboam wole Abia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abia wole Asa.<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa wole Yehosafat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehosafat wole Yehoram,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehoram wole Uzia.<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzia wole Yotam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam wole Ahas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas wole Hezekia.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekia wole Manase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase wole Amon,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Amos.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Amos.”</char></note> wole Yosia,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Kora bɔ bɛfa bɛ bɛkɔ Babilon ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:11">Yosia wole Yekonia ne oliema mɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Bɛhɔle Babilon ne si ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Yekonia wole Sealtiel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Sealtiel wole Zerubabel,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabel wole Abihud,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abihud wole Eliakim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliakim wole Asor.<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asor wole Sadok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadok wole Akim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim wole Elihud.<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elihud wole Eleaser,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleaser wole Matan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Matan wole Yakob.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakob wole Yosef bɔ ogyale Mary ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:16">Mary yeɛ owole Yesu bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kristo ne.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Yeti, aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ne, ofi Abraham so ɔbaadwu David so ne te aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ 14; ofi David so ɔbaadwu kyɛ bɛfale bɛ bɛhɔle Babilon ne te aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ 14; na bɛhɔle Babilon ne ɔbaadwu Kristo so ne te aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ 14.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Atee bɔ bɛfale so bɛwole Yesu Kristo ne ɛhe: Bɛfale ye maame Mary bɛmane Yosef kyɛ ɔye bɔ ɔbaagya ye. Né onya hɔlle agyaa bo, nakoso bɛnwuni kyɛ honhom krongron amaa wanwonzɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Né ohu Yosef te teneneeniɛ, na né onguro kyɛ ogua ye nyunu ase, yeti ɔyɛle ye adwene kyɛ okoyira ye kodɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ogu so ɔdwene ɛhe anwo ne, Awurade bɔfo yele ye nwo ali hyirele ye wɔ nnaleɛ nu, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yosef, David awa, nnɛsuro kyɛ ɛkɔfa ɛye Mary kɔhɔ awuro, ofikyɛ honhom krongron yeɛ wamaa wawonzɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ɔkɔwo baa brienzua, na odikyɛ ɛto ye dumaa Yesu, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ okole ye mmenia kofi bɛ bɔne nu ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ɛhe amukoraati sili, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, edwirɛ bɔ Awurade nate diifoɛ naso hane ne kɔwa nu ɔ. Ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Nea, ababunu ne kɔnwonzɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:23">ɔkɔwo baa brienzua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">na bɛkɔto ye dumaa Emmanuel,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:23">yebo kyire kyɛ, “Nyameɛ ne Yɛ Wɔ Berɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ná Yosef tingye fili nnaa nu, na ɔyɛle bɔ Awurade abɔfo ne ha hyirele ye ne, ɔfale ɔye ne hɔle awuro. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Nakoso Yosef ne ye anna tonn maa ɔwole baa brienzua ne, na ɔtole ye dumaa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛwole Yesu wɔ Betlehem bɔ ɔwɔ Yudea ne, Herode yeɛ né ɔte ɔhene ɔ. Na sɔ mmerɛ ne, mmenia biemɔ bɔ bɛnea nzramaa nu fili Eyia Afiteleɛ wale Yerusalem, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />na bɛbisale kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ hene bɔ bawo ye ne, nisua yeɛ ɔwɔ ɔ? Yɛnwuni ye nzramaa, mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ Eyia Afiteleɛ ne, na yawa kyɛ yɛbaasõ ye.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ɔhene Herode tele ɛhe ne, edwirɛ ne hale ye paa, na ɔhale Yerusalemfoɛ koso. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Yeti ɔfrɛle sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ maen nanu ne, na obisale bɛ nekaa bɔ ne bɛkɔwo Kristo ne.<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Betlehem bɔ ɔwɔ Yudea ne, ofikyɛ bɔ diifoɛ né hworɔle yeɛ ole kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Na wɔ Betlehem, bɔ ɔwɔ Yuda aseɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">sɛ ɔba Yuda atitire nu a, ɛtte maen baa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ofikyɛ, wɔ nu yeɛ ebie kofi kɔwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">kɔɔnea me maen Israel so ɔ.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Yeɛ Herode frɛle bɛ bɔ bɛnea nzramaa nu ne kodɛɛ, na obisale bɛ mmerɛ deinn bɔ nzramaa ne fitele ne. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Afei ɔsomane bɛ hɔle Betlehem, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔto ɛmɔ bo ase bɛpena akwalaa ne, sɛ ɛmɔnwu ye a ɛmɔbra bɛɛbɔ me amaneɛ, na me koso ngɔngoto ye bie. ”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Betiele Ɔhene ne dwirɛ ne beyiele ne, bɛsili nu kyɛ bɛkɔ, na nzramaa bɔ bɛnwuni ye ne lili bɛ nyunu alaa oogyinane awuro bɔ akwalaa ne wɔ nu ne ti afia. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Bɛnwuni nzramaa ne, bɛ nye gyele paa. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Na bɛhɔle awuro nanu ne, bɛnwuni akwalaa ne, ɔne ye maame Mary, na bɛbɔle bɛ nu ase bɛkotole ye. Afei bɛbukyele bɛ nningyein nu bɛhyɛle ye sikaa kɔkorɛ, insɛns, yeɛ kurobow.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Nakoso né Nyameɛ abɔ bɛ kɔkɔ wɔ nnaleɛ nu kyɛ, nnɛmaa besa bɛkɔ Herode dɔ. Yeti bɛfale atee foforɛ so bɛhɔle bɛ kuro.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Bɛhɔle ne, Awurade abɔfo yele ye nwo ali hyirele Yosef wɔ nnaleɛ nu, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso, fa akwalaa ne né ye maame nwati kɔ Egypt. Na tena berɛ kodwu kyɛ mene wɔ kodwudwo, ofikyɛ Herode pena akwalaa ne ku ye.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yeti Yosef dwɔsole, na kɔngɔen nala, ɔfale akwalaa ne né ye maame, na bɛnwati bɛhɔle Egypt. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ɔtenane berɛ tonn oodwuli kyɛ Herode wuli. Ɛhene maa bɔ Awurade nate diifoɛ naso hane ne wale nu kyɛ: “Mvrɛle mma ne mvili Egypt.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Herode nwuni kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛnea nzramaa nu né alaka-laka ye ne, ɔfɛle yaa paa. Na ɔhyɛle mmeraa kyɛ behu mmrienzua bɔ bɛwɔ Betlehem ne ye mandanu berɛ namu, ofi bɛ bɔ bawo bɛ foforɛ so ɔkwaadwu bɛ bɔ banya afoɛ nyɔ naso, kyɛbɔ mmenia bɔ bɛnea nzramaa nu ne maa onwuni ye ne pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ diifoɛ Yeremia hane ne koso wale nu kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Bɛtele konviɛ bie wɔ Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">esuɛ ne ndeɛteamuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahel yeɛ osu ye mmaa mɔ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">bɛkyekye ye wora po a, ondie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ofikyɛ bɛnne berɛ kõ.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Herode wue si ne, Awurade<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nea 2:13 ne bo berɛ dwirɛ ne.</char></note> bɔfo yele ye nwo ali hyirele Yosef wɔ nnaleɛ nu wɔ Egypt, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Dwɔso, fa akwalaa ne né ye maame sa kɔ Israel aseɛ so, ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛpena akwalaa ne beku ye, bɛ mukoraati bawu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yeti Yosef dwɔsole, na ɔfale akwalaa ne né ye maame hɔle Israel aseɛ so. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Nakoso, ɔtele kyɛ Arkelao yeɛ wasi ye baba Herode gya nu odi bia wɔ Yudea, yeti né osuro kyɛ ɔkɔhɔ berɛ. Afei koso, Nyameɛ bɔle ye kɔkɔ wɔ nnaleɛ nu, yeti ofili berɛ hɔle Galilea mandam nanu. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Na ɔɔtenane kuro bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Nazerɛt nu, na ɛhe maa bɔ adiifoɛ ne hane ne wale nu kyɛ: “Bɛkɔfrɛ ye Nazerɛtniɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, Yohane Suboniɛ wale Yudea serɛ so kyɛ ɔbaaha nzɛmba. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔsakra ɛmɔ adwene, ofikyɛ Anwuro Ahennie né apingye.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ɛhe yeɛ diifoɛ Isaiah hane ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Ebie tea nu wɔ ɛserɛ naso kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Ɛmɔsiesie Awurade atee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Ɛmɔma ye atee ne tengyɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Atadeɛ bɔ owura Yohane ne, afunum nwiaa yeɛ né bafa bayɛ ɔ, na né wafa kaka nwomaa wayɛ ye bɛlɛt.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Abɔsoɛ.”</char></note> Aleɛ bɔ ne odi yeɛ ole mmɛbɛ ne woɛ bɔ ɔwɔ eburo ne. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Né mmenia fi Yerusalem ne Yudea ne Yordan mandanu berɛ mukoraati ba ye berɛ, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />sɛ bɛka bɛ bɔne a, né wabɔ bɛ asu wɔ Yordan nzue nanu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Nakoso onwuni kyɛ Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ pee ba nekaa bɔ ɔbɔ asu ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛkyerebene mmaa mɔ, nwa yeɛ ɔha hyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔnwati ɛyaa bɔ ɔba ne? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Ɛmɔsu mmaa bɔ okyire adwene-sakra. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Na nnɛmɔ nya adwene kyɛ, ‘Yɛ baba yeɛ ole Abraham.’ Ofikyɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, Nyameɛ kɔhora kɔmaa Abraham konya mmaa kofi nyɔboɛ hemɔ nu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Bafa akumaa ne bato bakaa ne ndii nanwo dada, yeti bakaa biala bɔ onzu mmaa pa ne, bɛkɔpɛ na bagyi bagua see nu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Me de, ɛmɔ adwene-sakra ti yeɛ mefa nzue mebɔ ɛmɔ asu ne, nakoso bɔ oli me si ɔba ne de, ole tumi tra me, na ye mmaboa po, menvata kyɛ me ye. Ye de honhom krongron ne see yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔbɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Otira nikye bɔ bɛfa behu hwiit so, na ɔkɔpra nekaa bɔ ohu hwiit gua ne kama-kama, na waboɔboa ye hwiit ne noa wagua pata so, na ndɛtɛ ne de, see bɔ onnua le yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔyera ye ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Yesu fili Galilea wale Yohane berɛ wɔ Yordan nwo kyɛ ɔbɔ ye asu. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Nakoso, né Yohane pena kyɛ osi ye atee, na obisale kyɛ: “Me mmom bɔ odikyɛ ɛbɔ me asu ne, afei de wɔ yeɛ ɛba me berɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Sɔ mmerɛ he de, de to nu, ofikyɛ sɔ atee he yeɛ yɛnate so yɛkɔyɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ɔ.” Yeti Yohane lɛ tole nu. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Yesu bɔle asu yiele, ná ofili nzue ne bo fitele ala pɛ, anwuro bukyele, na onwuni kyɛ Nyameɛ honhom ne ba ye so te kyɛ abubure. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Yeɛ konviɛ bie fili anwuro wale kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole mma bɔ medɔ ye, ná male ye mato nu ne.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Afei, honhom ne fale Yesu hɔle ɛserɛ so maa Abɔnzam sɔle ye neane. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ɔyɛle akɔngyere ngyẽa 40, eyia ne kɔngɔen ne, né ɛhɔen ku ye. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ná bɔ ɔsɔ mmenia nea ne wale ye berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne a, dwudwo kyire nyɔboɛ hemɔ ma bɛkakyi paanoo.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">‘Nná paanoo ngome yeɛ ɔkɔmaa sona konya ngoa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:4">mmom edwirɛ biala bɔ ofi Awurade noa nu kɔwa ne.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Afei Abɔnzam fale ye hɔle kuro krongron nanu, na ɔfale ye gyinane nekaa bɔ ɔwale paa wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ awa ne a, gyi wɔ nwo to aseɛ nwo dɔ. Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Wɔ ti, ɔkɔhyɛ ye abɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">maa bɛkɔsoa wɔ bɛ sa so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">wɔ gya ngɔpoli nyɔboɛ ɔ.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Bahworɔ kyɛ: ‘Nnɛsɔ Awurade, wɔ Nyameɛ nea.’” <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Afei, Abɔnzam fale ye hɔle bokaa tendee bie so, na ɔfale ahennie bɔ ɔwɔ wiase, ne enu anuonyam mukoraati hyirele ye. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Sɛ ɛbɔ wɔ nu ase komapɛ sõ me a, ngɔfa ɛhe amukoraati ngɔma wɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Na Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fi me so, Satan! Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">‘Awurade wɔ Nyameɛ ngome yeɛ odikyɛ ɛkoto ye ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:10">na ye ngome yeɛ odikyɛ ɛsõ ye ɔ.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Afei Abɔnzam yakyile ye berɛ hɔle, na abɔfo wale bɛɛsone ye.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu tele kyɛ bahye Yohane bato prizin ne, ɔhɔle Galilea. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ofili Nazerɛt ne, ɔɔtenane Kapernaum, sɔ kuro ne la ɛpo noa wɔ Sebulun ne Naftali mandanu berɛ, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, edwirɛ bɔ diifoɛ Isaiah hane ne kɔwa nu ɔ, ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“O Sebulun aseɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">ne Naftali aseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">aseɛ bɔ ɔwɔ ɛpo atee naso wɔ Yordan si dɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">maen-maen né Galilea ne.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Mmenia bɔ bɛte awosii nu ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">banwu kanea kandinga bie;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">na bɛ bɔ bɛte nekaa bɔ ewue wawoɛ la ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">kanea atɔ bɛ so.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, Yesu hyɛle ye asɛnka adwuma nabo, na ɔhane kyɛ, “Ɛmɔsakra ɛmɔ adwene, ofikyɛ anwuro Ahennie ne apingye.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu nate Galilea ɛpo ne noa ne, onwuni mmenia nyɔ bie, né bɛte aliemaa, Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne, ɔne oliema Andrea kyɛ bɛgua nɛt wɔ ɛpo nanu, ofikyɛ né bɛkye egyein. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛmɔbra beeli me si, na ngɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔhye mmenia.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Na ɛberɛ nala, bɛyakyile bɛ nɛt ne berɛ bɛlili ye si. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Na ofili berɛ ne, osa nwuni aliemaa nyɔ bie, Sebedeo awa Yakobo, ne oliema Yohane. Né bɛne bɛ baba Sebedeo te ɛlɛen nu, na ne bɛpomba bɛ nɛt. Yesu frɛle bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />na ɛbrɛ ala bɛyakyile bɛ baba ne ɛleɛn ne berɛ bɛɛlili ye si.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Afei, Yesu hyinini Galilea mukoraati yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu hane Ahennie nanwo nzɛmba ne, na ɔsale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne bɛ bɔ bayɛ mmerɛ namukoraati anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Na ye nwo dwirɛ trɛ hɔle Siria mukoraati, na bɛfale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ, bɛ bɔ ɔhaw ahoroɛ teetee bɛ, bɛ bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so, bɛ bɔ bɛpɛ, ɔne bɛ bɔ babubu mukoraati bɛbrɛle ye, na ɔsale b'anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ɛhe ati, mmeni pee fili Galilea, Dekapoli, Yerusalem, Yudea, ne Yordan si dɔ lili ye si.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu nwuni ɛlɔen ne, ɔhɔle bokaa naso; na ɔtenane ase ne, ye asuafoɛ ne wale ye nwo berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Na ɔhyɛle yebo hyirehyirele bɛ kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛnwu ye kyɛ behia Nyameɛ akwankyerɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ anwuro Ahennie ne te bɛ deɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛ wora abɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ofikyɛ bɛkɔkyekye bɛ wora.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Anigye yeɛ ole anwobraseɛfoɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ bekonya aseɛ ne ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ tenenee nwo hɔen ne nzuhɔen ku bɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ofikyɛ bɛ ko koyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛnwu mmenia anwunvoin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ofikyɛ bɛ koso, bɛkonwu bɛ anwunvo.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ b'ahone nu te ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ofikyɛ bɛkonwu Nyameɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛboka maa asomdwie ba ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ofikyɛ bɛkɔfrɛ bɛ Nyameɛ mmaa.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Anigye yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ tenenee ti, bɛnwu amaneɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ofikyɛ anwuro Ahennie ne te bɛ deɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Anigye yeɛ ole ɛmɔ bɔ me ti, mmenia bɔ ɛmɔ alapaa, bɛtane ɛmɔ nye, na bɛpɛ ngondombo bɛka edwirɛ tɛɛ bɛfa ɛmɔ nwo ne. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye na ɛmɔli ahurusi, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ akatua bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne te piri; sɔ ala yeɛ ne bɛtane adiifoɛ bɔ beli ɛmɔ nyunu ne nye ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Ɛmɔte aseɛ he aso ngyee, nakoso, sɛ ngyee fɛɛ fi nu a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne wasa wanya ye bieku? Ɔba sɔ a, mvasoɛ biala nne so kõ, sana begyi bɛgua maa mmenia tietia so.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Ɛmɔte wiase ne kanea. Kuro bɔ ɔla bokaa so ne, ɔngora fea. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Sɔ ala yeɛ sɛ bɛsɔ kanea a, bɛmva benwura kɛndɛn bo, mmom bɛfa besie kanea bakaa so, ná wata maa ebiala anwu awuro berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ kanea ta wɔ mmenia nyunu, ná banwu ɛmɔ nneyɛɛ pa ne, na bahyɛ ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne anuonyam.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Nnɛmɔ nya adwene kyɛ, mmale kyɛ me baasɛkye Mmeraa anaa Adiifoɛ ne. Mamma kyɛ me baasɛkye ye, mmom, mema ɔba nu. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, kodwu kyɛ anwuro ne aseɛ kɔpɛ nu ne, Mmeraa nanu ndworɔyɛ kamba kõ, anaa nikye bɔ osa ndworɔyɛ nanwo ne komapɛ po nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔpɛ nu, bɔ ɔngɔwa nu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ okobu mmeraa nanu ahyɛdeɛ ne komapɛ po so, na ɔkɔha kohyire mmenia kyɛ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, bɛkɔfrɛ ye kamba wɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu. Nakoso ebiala bɔ odi so, na okyirekyire mmenia kyɛ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, bɛkɔfrɛ ye sona titire wɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔ tenenee ammo atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ deɛ naso a, ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔ wura anwuro Ahennie nanu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Ɛmɔ tele kyɛ, bɛha bɛhyirele tetefoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: ‘Nnɛdi awue, na ebiala bɔ okoli awue ne, okoli fɔ wɔ kɔɔto.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔtaa fɛ oliema so yaa ne, okoli fɔ wɔ kɔɔto; na ebiala bɔ ɔka edwirɛ bɔ ɔyɛ yea tia oliema ne koli fɔ wɔ kɔɔto kandinga nanu; yeɛ ebiala bɔ ɔka kyɛ, ‘Ɛte kwasea-mbane!’ ne, bɛkɔfa ye bɛkɔto <char style="tl">Gehenna</char> see bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru nanu.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Sɛ́ ɛfa w'akyɛdeɛ ba afɔleɛ bokyea ne nyunu, na ɛberɛ ala ɛkaye kyɛ eliema bie ne wɔ le edwirɛ a, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />yakyi w'akyɛdeɛ ne wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea ne nyunu, na kɔ. Di moa ne eliema ne siesie ɛmɔ afia, kora ne aabɔ w'afɔleɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Sɛ ebie sama wɔ a, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nate atee so bɛkɔ ne, ɛne ye siesie ɛmɔ afia. Wanyɛ sɔ a, ɔkɔfa wɔ kɔma temmufoɛ ne, na ye koso ɔkɔfa wɔ kɔma somvoɛ ne maa ɔkɔfa wɔ kɔto prizin. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nahorɛ nu, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, sɛ andua kerɛ namukoraati a, bɛngɔ ye wɔ ma ɛngɔhɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Ɛmɔ tele kyɛ bɛha behyirele bɛ kyɛ: ‘Nnɛsɛkye agyaa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔnea brasua tonn konya akɔnnɔ kɔma ye ne, ɔne ye asɛkye agyaa wɔ y'ahone nu. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Sɛ wɔ nye famaa to wɔ sintidua a, tu, na gyi to. Ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔhwere w'akwaa bie, tra kyɛ ɛkɔto wɔ nipadua mukoraati kɔto <char style="tl">Gehenna</char>. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Na sɛ wɔ sa famaa to wɔ sintidua a, pɛ, na gyi to. Ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔhwere w'akwaa bie, tra kyɛ ɛkɔto wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔto <char style="tl">Gehenna</char>.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Afei, bɛhane kyɛ: ‘Ebiala bɔ okoyira ɔye ne, ɔma ye krataa bɔ okyire kyɛ wayira ye ɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛye bɔlle adwaman, na eyira ye a, ɔkɔhora kɔmaa ɔkɔsɛkye agyaa. Na ebiala bɔ okogya brasua bɔ bayira ye ne, wasɛkye agyaa.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Afei koso, ɛmɔtele kyɛ bɛha behyirele tetefoɛ ne kyɛ: ‘Nnɛta ndaen bɔ ɛngɔhora so di, mmom sɛ ɛhyɛ Awurade bɔ a, di so.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Nnɛmɔ ta ndaen koraa, nnɛta anwuro ndaen, ofikyɛ ɔte Nyameɛ bia;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire bia bɔ ɔhene tena so ne</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />nnɛta aseɛ koso ndaen, ofikyɛ ɛwa yeɛ ye gya gyi ɔ; afei nnɛta Yerusalem ndaen, ofikyɛ ɔte Ɔhene kandinga ne kuro. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Nnɛta wɔ ti nwiaa ndaen, ofikyɛ ɛngɔhora ngɔmaa wɔ ti nwiaa komapɛ po ngɔyɛ fufue anaa bire. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ɛmɔ de, sɛ ɛmɔka ‘Yoo’ a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ yoo, na sɛ ‘Daabi’ koso a, ɔyɛ daabi, ɛhe si ne, bɔ ɛmɔkɔha biala fi ɔbɔnefoɛ ne berɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Ɛmɔtele kyɛ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ, ‘Anyeɛ si anyeɛ gya nu, na agyee si agyee gya nu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Nnɛmɔ ne ɔbɔnefoɛ pere, sɛ ebie bɔ wɔ so famaa nu a, kakyi bɛen ne ma ye. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Sɛ ebie fa wɔ kɔ kɔɔto, kyɛ ɔpena kyɛ odɛ w'atadeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ yebo ne a, fa bɔ ogua so ne koso ma ye; <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />na sɛ ebie bɔ ole tumi hyɛ wɔ kyɛ ɛmɔpɛ kwanzii kõ a, ɛne ye pɛ kwanzii nyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Sɛ ebie serɛ wɔ nikye a, fa ma ye, na sɛ ebie pena kyɛ ɛbɔ ye bosea a, nnɛbɔ ye atienuserɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Ɛmɔtele kyɛ, bɛhane kyɛ, ‘Dɔ wɔ mmango, ne kyi wɔ tamfo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛlɔ ɛmɔ atamfo, na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma bɛ bɔ bɛtane ɛmɔ nye ne, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ɛhe yeɛ okyire kyɛ ɛmɔte ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne mmaa mɔ ɔ. Ye yeɛ ɔmaa eyia fite mmeni pa, ne mmeni tɛɛ mukoraati so, na ɔmaa nzue tɔ gua ateneneefoɛ ne abɔnefoɛ mukoraati so ne. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Sɛ ɛmɔdɔ bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ɛmɔ ne ngome a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɛmɔ konya ye ɔ? Bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne po, nná sɔ yeɛ bɛyɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Na sɛ ɛmɔ aliema mɔ ngome yeɛ ɛmɔ kyẽa bɛ a, nzu yeɛ ne ɛmɔ ayɛ maa wabo so ɔ? Nná sɔ ala yeɛ wiasefoɛ ne koso yɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Na kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne yɛ ye nikye biala pɛpɛɛpɛ ne, ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔyɛ sɔ ala.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Ɛmɔnea yé, na ɛmɔ anyɛ ɛmɔ tenenee wɔ mmenia nyunu, kyɛbɔ bekonwu ɛmɔ ɔ. Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ sɔ a, ɛmɔngonya akatua biala nngofi ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne berɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Yeti, sɛ ɛmɔkwaayɛ adɔyɛ a, nnɛmɔ bɔ awɛen bɛdi ɛmɔ nyunu kyɛbɔ nyaatwomfoɛ nemɔ yɛ ye wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu ne dwaaso maa mmenia kamvo bɛ ne. Nahorɛ nu, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, banya b'akatua namukoraati bayie. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Nakoso wɔ de, sɛ ɛkwaayɛ adɔyɛ a, nnɛmaa wɔ sa bɛen nwu bɔ wɔ sa famaa ne yɛ ne, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a w'adɔyɛ ne kɔyɛ kokoanu deɛ. Ɛhene yeɛ wɔ Baba bɔ ɔnea kokoanu ne kotua wɔ kerɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Na sɛ ɛmɔ bɔ mbaeɛ a, nnɛmɔyɛ ye kyɛ nyaatwomfoɛ ne, bɛ de, bɛpena kyɛ bɛbɔ mbaeɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, anaa dwaaso, nekaa bɔ mmenia konwu bɛ ɔ. Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, banya b'akatua mukoraati dada. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nakoso, wɔ de, sɛ ɛbɔ mbaeɛ a, kɔ wɔ sua nu, to w'anoa nu, na bɔ wɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ kokoanu ne mbaeɛ. Ɛhene yeɛ wɔ Baba bɔ ɔnea kokoanu ne kotua wɔ kerɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Sɛ ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ a, nnɛmɔ dwudwo pee<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛmɔtĩ edwirɛ komapɛ nu bɛka ye pee.”</char></note> kyɛbɔ wiasefoɛ ne yɛ ne. B'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, sɛ bɛdwudwo pee a,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Betĩ edwirɛ nanu a.”</char></note> ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa bɛkotie bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Nnɛmɔyɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ne bie, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ Baba ne se bɔ ohia ɛmɔ kora yeɛ ɛmɔ bisa ye ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />“Sɔa yeɛ ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ ɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Yɛ Baba bɔ ɛwɔ anwuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">wɔ dumaa nwo te.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />W'Ahennie bra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Bɔ ɛkuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ wɔ aseɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔ so wɔ anwuro ne.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ma yɛ aleɛ bɔ ɔkɔso yɛ ɛnɛ,<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />na fa yɛ bɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kerɛ.”</char></note> kyɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">kyɛbɔ yafa yahyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ yɛ bɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kyɛbɔ yɛfa yɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛma yɛ kerɛ ne.”</char></note> ne.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Nnɛfa yɛ kɔ nzɔhwɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">mmom dɛ́ yɛ fi ɔbɔnefoɛ ne sa nu.’”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dɛ́ yɛ fi bɔne nu.”</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Sɛ ɛmɔfa amanvoɛ bɔne bɛkyɛ bɛ a, ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne koso kɔfa ɛmɔ deɛ kɔhyɛ ɛmɔ; <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />nakoso, sɛ ɛmɔ amva amanvoɛ bɔne bangyɛ bɛ a, ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne koso ngɔfa ɛmɔ deɛ ngɔhyɛ ɛmɔ lle.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ akɔngyere a, nnɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ nyunu bosaa te kyɛ nyaatwomfoɛ ne, ofikyɛ bɛyɛ bɛ nyunu bosaa na wamaa mmenia anwu kyɛ bɛyɛ akɔngyere. Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, banya b'akatua mukoraati dada. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Nakoso, wɔ de, sɛ ɛyɛ akɔngyere a, fa sakyeɛ popa wɔ ti anu, na nwunzi wɔ nyunu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, mmenia ngonwu kyɛ ɛyɛ akɔngyere. Mmom wɔ Baba bɔ onwu kokoanu ne ngome yeɛ okonwu ye ɔ. Ɛhene yeɛ ɔkɔmaa wɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ kokoanu ne kotua wɔ kerɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Ɛmɔyakyi agyapadeɛ bɔ ɛmɔboɔboa ye noa wɔ aseɛ he aso ne; ɛwa de mvrɔlɔ di, ɔwe naakye, na awiefoɛ kora wia. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Mmom, ɛmɔboa ɛmɔ agyapadeɛ noa wɔ anwuro, ɛberɛ de mvrɔlɔ nni, ɔnwe naakye, na awiefoɛ ngora nnwia. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ofikyɛ nekaa bɔ w'agyapadeɛ wɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ w'ahone wɔ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Anyeɛ yeɛ ɔte nipadua ne kanea ɔ. Yeti sɛ wɔ nye te pa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nea tee.”</char></note> a, wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔta hyireinn. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Nakoso, sɛ wɔ nye ttemaye a,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔnnea tee.”</char></note> wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔha awosii nu. Na sɛ kanea bɔ ɔwɔ wɔ nu ne te awosii a, ye de, né ye awosii ne te kabii pa.<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔsõ mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: Awura mɔ</char></note> nyɔ ɔ; ofikyɛ ɔkɔtane kõ, na wahuro kõ dwirɛ, anaakyɛ ɔkɔbata kõ anwo, na wabu kõ né animtia. Ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔsõ Nyameɛ ne ahonyadeɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Yeti, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Nnɛmɔ dwene ɛmɔ ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Kra.”</char></note> nwo kyɛ, nzu yeɛ yɛkoli, anaa nzu yeɛ yɛkɔno ɔ; anaa ɛmɔ nipadua nwo kyɛ nzu yeɛ yɛkowura ɔ. Aso, ngoa nhia ndra aleɛ, na nipadua ne ndra atadeɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Ɛmɔto ɛmɔ bo ase bɛnea ewienu nnomaa: Bɛnyɛ boo, bɛmbɛ, ná baboaboa ye noa bagua pata so, nakoso, ɛmɔ anwuro Baba ne ma bɛ aleɛ. Aso ɛmɔ nwo nhia ndra bɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ɛmɔ nu nwa yeɛ sɛ ɔdwene dee a, ɔkɔhora kɔfa dɔnhwere komapɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ekyire yebo tee a, ɔte: “Basafa kõ” anaa “Sentimita 45.”</char></note> po kɔboka ye ngoa so ɔ?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Na nzuati yeɛ ɛyɛ a ɛmɔha ɛmɔ nwo wɔ ndadeɛ nwo ɔ? Ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ flawa nyi ne, ná ɛmɔsua nikye bie bɛfi nu; bɛnyɛ adwuma, na bɛnwõ ɛtena. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, anuonyam bɔ Solomon nyane ye namukoraati si ne, wanziesie ye nwo kyɛ ɛhemɔ nu kõ po. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Na sɛ Nyameɛ wura eburo nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ, na ɛhema bagyi bagua see nu né ndaadeɛ a, ɔngowura ɛmɔ atadeɛ maa ɔngɔbo so? Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie te kaa ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Yeti, nnɛmɔ ha ɛmɔ nwo bɛdwene bɛka kyɛ, ‘Nzu yeɛ yɛkoli ɔ?’ anaa ‘Nzu yeɛ yɛkɔno ɔ?’ anaa ‘Nzu yeɛ yɛkowura ɔ?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ofikyɛ sɔ nningyein he yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ wiase ne nye aboro ye nwo ne. Nakoso, ɛmɔ anwuro baba ne se kyɛ ɛmɔhia sɔ nningyein he amukoraati. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔli moa bɛpena Ahennie ne, ɔne Nyameɛ tenenee, na ɔkɔfa sɔ nningyein he amukoraati kɔboka ɛmɔ so.” <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />“Yeti, nnɛmɔ dwene ɛhema nwo, ofikyɛ kyẽa ne bɔbɔ kɔdwene ye nwo. Kyẽa biala, ɔhaw bɔ ɔwɔ nu ne sone ma ye.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Nnɛmɔbu atɛn, ná bammu ɛmɔ atɛn; <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ ɛmɔbu mmenia atɛn ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛkobu ɛmɔ atɛn ɔ. Na kongo bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛsusu nikye bɛma mmenia ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkosusu bɛkɔma ɛmɔ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />“Nzuati yeɛ ɛkora nwu ndɛtɛ bɔ ɔla eliema nye so, ná mbuna<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuna te bakaa bɔ bɛfa bɛbɔ sua so.</char></note> bɔ ɔla wɔ bɔbɔ wɔ nye so ne de, ɛnnwu ye ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Na ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ahora aha ahyire eliema kyɛ, ‘Ma nye ndɛtɛ bɔ ɔla wɔ nye so ne, nakoso wɔ de, nea, mbuna yeɛ ɔla wɔ nye so ɔ?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Nyaatwomniɛ, di moa ye mbuna bɔ ɔla wɔ nye so ne, ɛhene kɔmaa ekonwu nikye yé, na ahora aye ndɛtɛ bɔ ɔla eliema ne nye so ne.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Nnɛmɔfa nikye bɔ ɔte krongron bɛma ngyea, na nnɛmɔfa agudeɛ pa bɛgua mbrako nyunu, ná bandietia so, bangakyi bɛ nwo bandete ɛmɔ nu.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbisa, na ɛmɔ sa kɔha ye; ɛmɔhɔ so bɛpena, na ɛmɔ konwu ye, na ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbɔnu, na bɛkɔbukye ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso bisa ne, ye sa ka ye; ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso pena ne, onwu ye, na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔso bɔnu ne, bɛbukye ye.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />“Ɛmɔ nu nwa, yeɛ ɔwa serɛ ye paanoo a, ɔkɔfa nyɔboɛ kowura ye sa nu ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Anaa ɔserɛ egyein a, ɔkɔfa ɛwoo kɔma ye ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte abɔnefoɛ ne po, sɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, odikyɛ ɛmɔma ɛmɔ mmaa mɔ nikye pa a, ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne ngɔfa nikye pa ngɔma bɛ bɔ bɛbisa ye ne ɔ?<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Yeti, nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔpena kyɛ mmenia yɛ ma ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔyɛ sɔ ala bɛma bɛ. Ofikyɛ sɔ ala yeɛ mmeraa ne adiifoɛ ne ka ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Ɛmɔfa anoa kamba nanu, ofikyɛ anoa piri ne atee kandinga ne kɔ ewue nu, na bɛ bɔ bɛnate so ne sone paa. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nakoso anoa kamba ne, ɔne atee fianwo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Teamaa.”</char></note> ne yeɛ ɔkɔ ngoa nu ɔ, ná mmenia kaa bie yeɛ bɛnwu ye ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo ye wɔ ngondombo adiifoɛ nwo, bɛba ɛmɔ berɛ a, ɛyɛ a ne bafa mmoan nwomaa bawura bɛ nwo, nakoso bɛte mbataku bɔ bɛdi adufum. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Bɛ mmaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nneyɛɛ.”</char></note> yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu bɛ ɔ. Aso, bɛtete bobe wɔ mmowie so, anaa bɛtete borɔdoma wɔ ɛfone so? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Sɔ ala yeɛ bakaa pa biala su mmaa pa, na bakaa bɔ ɔttemaye biala su mmaa tɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Bakaa pa ngɔhora ngosu mmaa tɛɛ, na bakaa bɔ ɔttemaye ngɔhora ngosu mmaa pa. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Bakaa biala bɔ onzu mmaa pa ne, bɛpɛ na bagyi bagua see nu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛ mmaa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nneyɛɛ.”</char></note> yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu bɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Nná ebiala bɔ ɔka kyire me kyɛ, ‘Awurade, Awurade’ ne yeɛ ɔkɔhɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu ɔ, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ bɔ me Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne kuro ne, bɛ yeɛ bɛkɔhɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, mmeni pee kɔha kohyire me kyɛ: ‘Awurade, Awurade, yɛfale wɔ dumaa yɛhyɛle ngɔm, yɛfale wɔ dumaa yɛtule sunzummɔne, na yɛfale wɔ dumaa yɛyɛle anwanwadeɛ pee!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ná ɛberɛ yeɛ ngɔha ngohyire bɛ kyɛ: ‘Menze ɛmɔ koraa! Ɛmɔfi me so bɛhɔ, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔttemaye.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Ebiala bɔ otie me dwirɛ he, na ɔfa yɛ adwuma ne, ɔte kyɛ nyanzaniɛ bie bɔ osili ye sua siele nyɔbotaen bie so ne. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Nzue tɔle, na oyili, na mvrama tu bɔle sua ne, nakoso wammu, ofikyɛ né wasi wasie nyɔbotaen so.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Na ebiala bɔ otie me dwirɛ, nakoso ɔmva nnyɛ adwuma ne, ɔkɔyɛ kyɛ kwasea bie bɔ osili ye sua siele anweaa nu ne. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Nzue tɔle, na oyili, na mvrama tu bɔle sua ne, na obuli, obubuli koraa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu dwudwo yiele ne, kyɛbɔ ohyirehyirele bɛ ne maa bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />ofikyɛ ne okyirekyire bɛ kyɛ ebie bɔ ole tumi, ná ɔtte kyɛ b'atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Odwu fili bokaa naso ne, mmeni pee lili ye si. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ná kwataniɛ bie wale ye berɛ, yeɛ obuli ndwerɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, ɛkuro a, ɛkɔhora kɔmaa me nwo kɔtɔ me.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ɛkɔmaa me nwo kɔte.”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Na ɔtengyɛle ye sa sɔle ye nu hane kyɛ: “Mekuro! Wɔ nwo tɔ wɔ.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Wɔ nwo te.”</char></note> Na ɛberɛ ala, ye kwata ne hɔle. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea ná anga angyire ebiala, mmom kɔ, na kɔfa wɔ nwo kyire sɔfo nemɔ, na fa akyɛdeɛ bɔ Mose hyɛle ne ma bɛ, na ɔyɛ adanzeɛ ma bɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Owurale Kapernaum ne, sogyaniɛ panyi bie wale ye berɛ, na ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Me wura, m'akoaa abubu la awuro, na onwu amaneɛ paa.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Medwu dɔ a, ngɔsa ye anwonyerɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Sogyaniɛ panyi ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Me wura, memvata kyɛ ɛba m'awuro, wɔ de ka edwirɛ bie, na m'akoaa ne nwo kɔtɔ ye. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ofikyɛ nwura mmeraa bo, na nne sogyafoɛ bɔ bɛwura me bo. Meka mekyire ebie kyɛ, ‘Kɔ’ a, né wahɔ, na meka mekyire sona foforɛ koso kyɛ, ‘Bra!’ na wawa, na m'akoaa koso, meka mekyire ye kyɛ, ‘Yɛ ɛhe,’ ne wayɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ɔyɛle ye nwanwa, na ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛli ye si ne kyɛ: “Nahorɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, nnwuni ebiala bɔ ole gyidie piri sɔa wɔ Israel. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ, mmeni pee kofi eyia afiteleɛ, ne eyia atɔleɛ kɔwa, na bɛne Abraham, Isaac, ne Yakob kɔtena tɛbulu nwo kodidi wɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu; <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />nakoso Ahennie ne mmaa ne de, bɛkogyi bɛ bɛkogua awosii nu wɔ aluo. Ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛkosu, na bɛ anwose bɛ gye.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele sogyaniɛ panyi ne kyɛ: “Kɔ. Na kyɛbɔ ahyire kyɛ ɛle gyidie ne, ɔyɛ berɛ ma wɔ.” Na sɔ mmerɛ nala, ye akoaa ne nwo tɔle ye.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Afei Yesu hɔle Petro awuro, odwuli berɛ ne, onwuni kyɛ ye sia brasua la berɛ bɔ <char style="tl">fiiva</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebunu.”</char></note> ahye ye. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yeti, ɔsɔle ye sa nu, na <char style="tl">fiiva</char> ne hɔle. Yeɛ maame ne dwɔsole, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔsõ ye. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Sɔ nnɔsoa ne, bɛfale mmeni pee bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so bɛwale Yesu berɛ. Ɔfale ye noa nu dwirɛ tuli sunzummɔne nemɔ, na ɔsale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ né anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ diifoɛ Isaiah hane ne wale nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Ye yeɛ ɔfale yɛ ahotutuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">na ɔsoale yɛ anwonyerɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu nwuni kyɛ mmenia pee apɛ ye nwo ayia ne, ɔha hyirele asuafoɛ ne kyɛ bɛhɔ nzue ne si dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Na atwerɛfoɛ nanu kõ wale berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, nekaa biala bɔ ɛkɔhɔ ne, mene wɔ kɔhɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu koso ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kangane mɔ le bɔen, na ewienu nnomaa le buye, nakoso sona Awa ne de, olle nekaa bɔ ɔfa ye ti po to ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ná asuafoɛ nanu kõ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, ma nni moa ngɔnzie me baba kora.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Di me si, na awufo sie b'awufo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu tenane ɛleɛn nanu ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ lili ye si. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Afei, mvrama kandinga bie tuli wɔ ɛpo naso, na né asorɔkye ne pena kata ɛlɛen naso; nakoso Yesu de, né wala. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Yeti bɛtingyele ye, na bɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Awurade, dɛ́ yɛ, na yawu yayie.” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Nakoso, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie te kaa, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ amaa esuronyi aha ɛmɔ ne?” Na ɔdwɔso teɛteane nzue ne mvrama ne, na bɛyɛle konn. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Yeti ɔyɛle mmrienzua ne nwanwa maa bɛhane kyɛ: “Sona beni ɛhe, bɔ mvrama ne ɛpo po tie ye ne?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Odwuli nzue ne si dɔ, Gadarafoɛ aseɛ naso ne, mmrienzua nyɔ bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so fili asieleɛ naso yiale ye. Né bɛ nye so yɛ hye paa, yeti né ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkora fa sɔ atee naso ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Na bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Nyameɛ Awa, nzu yeɛ ɔwɔ yɛne wɔ afia ɔ? Awa ɛwa kyɛ ɛbaaha yɛ kora ne mmerɛ ne aso?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Né mbrako pee mbaen bie wɔ dede bɛdidi. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Yeti sunzummɔne nemɔ srɛle Yesu kyɛ: “Sɛ etu yɛ a, maa yɛɛwura sɔ mbrako nemɔ nu.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛmɔhɔ!” Yeti bɛfili bɛ nu bɛɛwurale mbrako nemɔ nu. Na mbrako namukoraati tuli mirika fili bokaa naso beeguale ɛpo nanu, na bɛwuli wɔ nzue nanu. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Yeti bɛ bɔ ne bɛnea mbrako ne nwatili, na bɛhɔle kuro nanu bɛɛhane bɔ wasi namukoraati, bɛhane mmrienzua bɔ otuli sunzummɔne ne fili bɛ nu ne koso nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Na kuro nanufoɛ mukoraati wale kyɛ bɛ baapena Yesu. Bɛnwuni ye ne, bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ofi bɛ mandanu berɛ hɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yeti ɔfolo ɛleɛn ne, na osa hɔle ye bɔbɔ ye kuro. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Na bɛfale ebie bɔ wabubu la bɛen so bɛbrɛle ye. Yesu nwuni bɛ gyidie ne, ɔha hyirele bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ: “Mma, ka w'ahone to wɔ kunu, bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Afei, né atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ bie keka kyire bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Akoaa he ka mmusue dwirɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yesu nwuni adwene bɔ otira bɛ ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ anya adwemmɔne wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu ne? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Beni yeɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ɔ? Kyɛ ɛkɔha kyɛ, ‘Bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ,’ anaa ɛkɔha kyɛ, ‘Dwɔso na nate.’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Nakoso, bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ sona Awa ne le tumi wɔ aseɛ he aso kyɛ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ ne,” ɔha hyirele bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ: “Dwɔso, fa wɔ bɛen, na kɔ awuro.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Na ɔdwɔso hɔle ye awuro. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mmenia ne nwuni ɛhe ne, esuronyi hane bɛ, na bɛhyɛle Nyameɛ bɔ ɔfale sɔ tumi ne mane sona né anuonyam.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu fili berɛ, na ɔkɔ ne, onwuni biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Mateo, né ɔte nekaa bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne. Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baali me si.” Na ɛberɛ nala, odwɔso lili ye si.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesi ne, mmerɛ bɔ Yesu wɔ Mateo awuro odidi ne, bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ pee wale berɛ, na bɛne ye, ne ye asuafoɛ ne tole asaa didili. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Farisifoɛ nemɔ nwuni ɛhe ne, bɛha bɛhyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne, nzuati yeɛ ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ didi ne?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Bɛ bɔ bɛte apɔ ne, benhia dɔktaniɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne mmom yeɛ behia dɔktaniɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ɛmɔhɔ beesua bɔ edwirɛ he kyire ɔ: ‘Mekuro anwunvoin, ɔtte afɔleɛ.’ Nná ateneneefoɛ ti yeɛ mmale ɔ, mmale kyɛ mebaafrɛ abɔnefoɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Yesi ne, Yohane asuafoɛ ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ yɛ akɔngyere, na w'asuafoɛ nemɔ de, bɛnyɛ bie ne?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne wɔ ye nnamvo mɔ nwo ne, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne bɛ wora abɔ? Nakoso mmerɛ bie kɔwa bɔ bɛkɔfa brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne bɛkɔhɔ, sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛkɔyɛ akɔngyere. <verse eid="MAT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Ná ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa ɛtena monɛ ta atadeɛ daa nu ɔ, ofikyɛ ɛtena monɛ ne kɔte kofi daa nanu, na ɔba sɔ a, atadeɛ ne kɔte piri kɔtra daa ne. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Afei koso, bɛmva nzãa foforɛ bengua nzãa bɔtɔ daa nu. Sɛ bɛyɛ sɔ a, bɔtɔ ne kɔpakye maa nzãa ne kohwie kogua, ná nzãa bɔtɔ ne koso kɔsɛkye. Yeti bɛfa nzãa foforɛ bɛgua nzãa bɔtɔ monɛ nu, na ye munyɔ né anzɛkye.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ogu so ɔka sɔ dwirɛ ne, panyi bie wale berɛ, na obuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu hane kyɛ: “Kesaalae de, medɛ́ medi kyɛ mma brasua ne awu, nakoso bra, na baafa wɔ sa gua ye so, ná ɔkɔwa ngoa nu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu dwɔsole, na ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ lili ye si. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Na brasua bie bɔ mogya atu ye afoɛ 12 fale ye si, na ɔfale ye sa sɔle ye atadeɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ye atadeɛ bɔ ogua ye so ne.”</char></note> ne noa. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Edwirɛ bɔ ne ɔka yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Sɛ mefa me sa mesɔ ye atadeɛ nanu mbaen po a, me nwo kɔtɔ me.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu kakyile ye nwo, ná onwuni ye ne, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baa brasua, ka w'ahone to wɔ kunu! Wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ.” Na sɔ mmerɛ nala, maame ne nwo tɔle ye.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Afei Yesu wurale panyi n'awuro berɛ, na onwuni bɛ bɔ bɛhu awɛen, ne mmenia bɔ bɛsu ne, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfite, ofikyɛ abayaa ne wulli, wala.” Bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛserele ye. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Mmenia ne fitele ne, ɔhɔle nekaa bɔ abayaa ne la ne, na ɔsɔle ye ne sa nu maa ɔdwɔsole. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Nahorɛ nu, ɛhe anwo dwirɛ trɛ hɔlɛ mandanu berɛ mukoraati.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu fili berɛ, na ɔkɔ ne, anyesiniwaafoɛ nyɔ bie lili ye si, na né bɛteɛtea nu kyɛ: “David awa, nwu yɛ anwunvo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ɔhɔle awuro nanu ne, bɛwale ye berɛ, yeɛ Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔdɛ bɛdi kyɛ ngɔhora ngɔyɛ ɛhe?” Na bɛhane kyɛ: “Yoo! Awurade.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Yeɛ ɔfale ye sa hane bɛ nye ne, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ gyidie te ne, ɔyɛ sɔ ma ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na bɛ nye ne tele. Nakoso Yesu bɔle bɛ kɔkɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea yé, na ebiala ande ye nwo dwirɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Nakoso bɛfitele ne, bɛbɔle ye nwo dawure wɔ mandanu berɛ mu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Bɛ́fi berɛ bɛkɔ ne, bɛfale ɛmumu bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so bɛbrɛle ye; <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yesu tule sunzummɔne ne fili ye nu nala, ɛmumu ne dwudwole. Na ɔyɛle mmenia ne nwanwa maa bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, ebie silli Israel lle.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Nakoso Farisifoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Sunzummɔne panyi ne tumi yeɛ ɔfa tu sunzummɔne ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu hyinini nguro ne nnamue nemɔ nu, ohyirehyirele mmenia nemɔ wɔ bɛ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu, na ɔhane Ahennie nanwo nzɛmba ne. Ɔsale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne bɛ bɔ bayɛ mmerɛ namukoraati anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Onwuni mmeni lɔen ne, bɛyɛle ye anwunvo, ofikyɛ ne bayɛ kyɛ mmoan bɔ bapire-pira bɛ bayakyi bɛ berɛ, bɔ belle ebiala bɔ ɔnea bɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Yeti, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Ɛboo nanu nningyein bɔ odikyɛ yɛpɛ ne sone, nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma ne te kaa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Yeti, ɛmɔsrɛ ɛboo ne Wura ne kyɛ, ɔma adwumayɛfoɛ pee bra, ná bɛɛpɛ bie.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yeti ɔfrɛle asuafoɛ 12 ne, na ɔmane bɛ tumi bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔtu sunzummɔne, ná basa bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ, ɔne bɛ bɔ bayɛ mmerɛ ne anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Asuafoɛ 12 ne dumaa ɛhe: Simon bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne, ɔne oliema Andrea; Sebedeo awa Yakobo, ne oliema Yohane, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo, ne Bartolomeo; Tomas ne Mateo bɔ odidɛ toɔ ne; Alfeo awa Yakobo, ne Tadeo;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besa bɛfrɛ ye “Yakobo awa Yuda.”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simon bɔ ofi Kanaan ne, ɔne Yuda Iskariot bɔ ɔyele ye mane ne.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu somane mmenia 12 he, na ɔhyɛle bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ kɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne berɛ, ná nnɛmɔ wura Samariafoɛ kuro biala nu; <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Israelfoɛ bɔ bamini ne mmom yeɛ ɛmɔhɔ b'awuro ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Sɛ ɛmɔkɔ a<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔnate atee so bɛkɔ a.”</char></note> ɛmɔha kyɛ, ‘anwuro Ahennie ne apingye.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Ɛmɔsa anwonyerɛ, ɛmɔtingye awufo, ɛmɔma akwatafoɛ nwo te, na ɛmɔtu sunzummɔne. Ɛmɔ nyane ye mbaen, yeti ɛmɔfa bɛma mbaen. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Nnɛmɔfa sikaa kɔkorɛ, dwetɛ, anaa kɔɔbere bɛbɔ ɛmɔ abɔsoɛ nu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Na nnɛmɔfa aleɛ bɔtɔ bɛtu atee ne, yeɛ nnɛmɔfa ndadeɛ nyɔ, mmaboa, anaa pɔmaa; ofikyɛ ebie yɛ adwuma a, ye aleɛ fata ye.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Kuro anaa nnamue biala bɔ ɛmɔ kowura nu ne, ɛmɔpena ebie bɔ ɔfata, na ɛmɔtena berɛ kodwu kyɛ ɛmɔ kofi berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Sɛ ɛmɔwura awuro bie nu a, ɛmɔhyea bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />na sɛ awura ne fata a, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ asomdwie bra so, na sɛ awuro ne mvata a, ɛmɔ asomdwie ne sa bra ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Nekaa biala bɔ banne ɛmɔ, anaa bandie ɛmɔ ne, sɛ́ ɛmɔfi sɔ awuro ne, anaa kuro nanu bɛkɔ a, ɛmɔ poro-poro ɛmɔ gya bo mvuture bɛgua berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, atemmuda ne, bɔ ɔkɔto sɔ kuro ne, Sodom ne Gomora deɛ ne po te kaa.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Nea, mesoma ɛmɔ kyɛ mmoan mekɔ mbataku nu, yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ kyɛ ɛwoo, na ɛmɔyɛ mmenia bɔ edwirɛ nne bɛ nwo te kyɛ mmubure. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Nakoso ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo ye wɔ mmenia nwo, ofikyɛ bɛkɔhwe ɛmɔ bɛkɔhɔ kɔɔto,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kɔɔto mmaa-mmaa.”</char></note> na bɛkogwa ɛmɔ wɔ bɛ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Me ti, bɛkɔfa ɛmɔ bɛkɔhɔ awaen ne ahemvo mɔ nyunu, ná wayɛ adanzeɛ wama maen-maen ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Nakoso, sɛ bɛfa ɛmɔ bɛkɔ a, nnɛmɔ dwene kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ kodwudwo, anaa bɔ ɛmɔkɔha nwo, ofikyɛ sɔ mmerɛ nala, bɛkɔfa bɔ ɛmɔkɔha ne bɛkɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Yeti nná ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ kodwudwo ɔ, mmom honhom bɔ ofi Baba ne berɛ ne, ye yeɛ ɔnate ɛmɔ so kodwudwo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Afei, aliemaa kɔye oliema kɔma maa bɛkɔhu ye, baba kɔye ɔwa kɔma, na ngwalaa kɔdwɔso kotia b'awofo, na bɛkɔmaa bɛkɔhu bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Na me ti, mmenia mukoraati kɔtane ɛmɔ; nakoso bɔ okogyina nu koodwu awieɛ ne, ye yeɛ bɛkole ye ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Sɛ bɛtane ɛmɔ nye wɔ kuro kõ nu a, ɛmɔhɔ foforɛ nu. Nahorɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nguro bɔ ɔwɔ Israel ne, ɛmɔngoyie nu adwuma, né sona Awa ne awa.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Suaniɛ ndra ye kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, na akoaa ndra ye wura. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Yeti sɛ suaniɛ kora bayɛ kyɛ ye kyerɛkyerɛniɛ a, ɛhene ala te pa, na akoaa koso yɛ kyɛ ye wura a, ɛhene ala te pa. Sɛ bɛfrɛ efiewura ne Beelsebub a, ye de, nná sɔ ala yeɛ bɛkɔfrɛ bɛ bɔ bɛte awuro berɛ ne ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Nakoso, nnɛmɔ suro bɛ, ofikyɛ nikye fee nne berɛ bɔ ɛso akata, bɔ ye nwo ngɔla berɛ, anaa wafia bɔ bɛngonwu ye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Bɔ ngɔha ngohyire ɛmɔ wɔ awosii nu ne, ɛmɔha ye eyia ketee, na bɔ ngɔha ngogua ɛmɔ soa nu ne, ɛmɔha ye sua ti afia. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Nnɛmɔ suro bɛ bɔ bɛku nipadua ne, nakoso bɛngora bɛngu ɔkra ne; mmom, ɛmɔsuro bɔ ɔkora sɛkye ɔkra ne né nipadua namukoraati wɔ <char style="w">Gehenna</char> ne. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Bɛtɔne ngasa-nnomaa nyɔ a, nná kaprɛ yeɛ bedɛ ɔ, anaa melaka? Nakoso bɛ nu komapɛ po ngɔtɔ ase bɔ ɛmɔ Baba ngonwu ye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ɛmɔ ti so nwiaa po, waha ye mukoraati. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Yeti nnɛmɔ suro, ɛmɔ nwo hia tra ngasa-nnomaa pee.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔbɔ me dumaa wɔ mmenia nu ne, me koso ngɔbɔ ye dumaa wɔ me baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne nyunu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔpo me wɔ mmenia nyunu ne, me koso ngɔpo ye wɔ me Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne nyunu. <verse eid="MAT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Nnɛmɔ nya adwene kyɛ asomdwie yeɛ mva mmale aseɛ he aso ɔ; mamva asomdwie mamma, mmom dadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ofikyɛ mmale kyɛ mebaatete mmenia nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">Ná baa brienzua adwɔso tia ye baba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">baa brasua adwɔso atia ye maame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">ná sia brasua adwɔso atia ye sia.<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebie abusuafoɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:36">yeɛ bɛkɔyɛ ye atamfo ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Ebiala bɔ okuro ye baba anaa ye maame dwirɛ tra me ne, ɔmvata me, na ebiala bɔ okuro ɔwa brienzua anaa brasua dwirɛ tra me ne, ye koso, ɔmvata me. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Na ebiala bɔ wamva ye asɛnnua wanni me si ne, ɔmvata kyɛ ɔyɛ me suaniɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Ebiala bɔ ɔpena ye ngoa ne, okofi ye sa, nakoso ebiala bɔ me ti ye ngoa kofi ye sa ne, ye sa kɔha ye.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Ebiala bɔ okole ɛmɔ ne, wale me, na ebiala bɔ okole me ne, wale bɔ ɔsomane me ne koso. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ diifoɛ, ɔnate kyɛ ɔte diifoɛ ne konya diifoɛ akatua. Na ebiala bɔ odɛ́ teneneeniɛ, ɔnate kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ ne konya teneneeniɛ akatua. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔma mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ nzue frɔlɔɔ kwangoa kõ maa ɔkɔno, ɔnate kyɛ ɔte me suaniɛ nati ne, nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ye akatua nngɔbɔ ye.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu dwudwo hyirele asuafoɛ 12 ne yiele ne, ofili berɛ kyɛ ɔkwaayɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ na ɔka nzɛmba ne wɔ nguro nemɔ nu.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Né Yohane ate nningyein bɔ Kristo ne yɛ nanwo dwirɛ wɔ prizin dɔ, yeti ɔsomane ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ bɛbra ye brɛ, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />na beebisa ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle bɔ ɔba ne, anaa yɛnea sona foforɛ atẽ?” <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔha bɔ ɛmɔte na ɛmɔnwu ye nanwo dwirɛ behyire Yohane kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />‘Anyesiniwaafoɛ sa nwu nikye, bɛ bɔ babubu ne nate, akwatafoɛ nwo te, na bɛ bɔ bɛ so ati ne te edwirɛ, awufo dwɔso, na baha nzɛmba ne bahyire ahiafoɛ;’ <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />anigye yeɛ ole ebiala bɔ mendo ye sintidua ne. ”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Yohane asuafoɛ nemɔ kɔ ne, Yesu hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔka Yohane nwo dwirɛ kyire mmenia nemɔ. Ɔhane kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle ɛserɛ naso kyɛ ɛmɔ kwaanea ne? Elemmire bɔ mvrama woso ye anaa? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Nná sɔ a, nzu yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle dɔ bɛɛneane ne? Biaa bie bɔ owura atadeɛ pa? Ɛmɔnea, bɛ bɔ bɛwura ndadeɛ pa ne tete ahemvie. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ye de, nzu deinn yeɛ ɛmɔhɔle dɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ kwaanea ne? Diifoɛ? Amba, meka mekyire ɛmɔ, ɔtra diifoɛ po. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ɛhe yeɛ bɛhworɔle ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">‘Nea, mesoma me bɔfoɛ maa odi wɔ nyunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">Ye yeɛ okosiesie atee nu kɔma wɔ’ ne.<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ mmrasua awo bɛ ne, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte piri tra Yohane Suboniɛ ɔ; nakoso bɔ ɔte kaa wɔ anwuro ahennie nanu ne, ɔte piri tra ye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ofi Yohane Suboniɛ aberɛ so bɔ ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ ne, anwuro Ahennie ne yeɛ ebiala pere kyɛ okodwu ye nwo ɔ, na bɛ bɔ bɛ nye aboro ne yeɛ bɛ sa ka ye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ofikyɛ Adiifoɛ ne Mmeraa namukoraati hyɛle ngɔm oodwuli Yohane so; <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Na sɛ ɛmɔkole bɛkɔto nu a, ye yeɛ ole Elia bɔ bɛhane kyɛ ɔba ne. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Nwamɔ po yeɛ mva sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he ndoto bɛ nwo ɔ? Bɛte kyɛ ngwalaa bɔ bɛte dwaaso, na bɛfrɛ bɛ mmango mɔ kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Yɛhule awɛen yɛmane ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">nakoso, ɛmɔ ango;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">yɛpɛle awuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">nakoso, ɛmɔ wora ammɔ.’<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Sɔ ala koso yeɛ Yohane wale ne, wannidi, na wanno nzãa, ná bɛnwa ‘Ole sunzummɔne.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Sona awa ne wale ne, ye de odidi, na ɔno, nakoso mmenia ka kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔnea adufum ne kɔwenzaniɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛdide ɛtoɔ ne abɔnefoɛ damvo ne!’ Nakoso nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ ne maa bɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔse nworɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Nguro bɔ Yesu yɛle anwanwadeɛ pee wɔ nu ne, banzakra, yeti ɔhyɛle yebo hwili bɛ nyunu kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Due Korasin! Due Betsaida! Ofikyɛ anwanwadeɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ye wɔ wɔ nu ne, sɛ bɛyɛle ye wɔ Tiro ne Sidon a, ahaa basakra bahra brisie bafa nzoen bayɛ bɛ nwo dada. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Yeti, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, Atemmuda ne, bɔ ɔkɔto ɛmɔ ne, ɔkɔtra Tiro ne Sidon deɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na wɔ, Kapernaum, ɛse kyɛ bɛkɔfa wɔ bɛkɔhɔ anwuro? Daabi oo! Kumaa nu tɔnn yeɛ bɛkɔfa wɔ bɛkɔhɔ ɔ. Ofikyɛ anwanwadeɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ye wɔ wɔ nu ne, sɛ bɛyɛle ye wɔ Sodom a, ahaa ɔbaadwu bekye, ɔtɛ́ wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, Atemmuda ne, bɔ ɔkɔto wɔ ne, Sodom deɛ ne po te kaa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Yesu hane kyɛ: “Baba, anwuro ne aseɛ Wura, meye wɔ ayɛ wɔ badwanu, ofikyɛ afa ɛhe afea anyanzafoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛse nwomaa ne, na ala ye ali ahyire ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Baba, ɔte nahorɛ, ofikyɛ ɛhe yeɛ ɔsɔ wɔ nye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Me Baba afa nikye biala awura me sa, na ebiala nze Baa ne yé, sana Baba ne; yeɛ ebiala nze Baba ne yé, sana Baa ne, ɔne ebiala bɔ Baa ne pena kyɛ ɔda ye ali kyire ye ne. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ afɛ, na bafa nningyein<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Adesoa.”</char></note> nnunɛ-nnunɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mbiri-mbiri.”</char></note> basoa ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔbra me berɛ, na ngɔmaa ɛmɔkole ɛmɔ nwomeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Ɛmɔfa me kɔnnua bɛto ɛmɔ nwo so, na ɛmɔsuesua me, ofikyɛ medwo, na mebrɛ me nwo ase wɔ ahone nu, na ɛmɔ konya ahotɔ bɛkɔma ɛmɔ kra.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ngoa” anaa “Ɛmɔ nwo.”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Ofikyɛ me kɔnnua ne soalɛ nnyɛ se, na m'adesoa nu yɛ nyera.” <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nu nnyɛ nno.”</char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, Yesu fale hwiit boo bie nu homeda. Né ɛhɔen ku ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, yeti bɛtetele hwiit ne bie bɛlili. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Na Farisifoɛ nemɔ nwuni ye sɔ ne, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea! Bɔ w'asuafoɛ nemɔ yɛ ne, mmeraa mma atee kyɛ bɛyɛ ye homeda.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ David yɛle, mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛhɔen ku ɔne ye mmrandeɛ nemɔ ne, ɛmɔ kenngale? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Kyɛbɔ ɔhɔle Nyameɛ awuro berɛ, na ɔne ye mmrandeɛ nemɔ lili paanoo bɔ ne bafa bawa Nyameɛ nyunu ne? Né mmeraa mma atee kyɛ ye, anaa bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne di bie, mmom asɔfo ngome yeɛ ne odikyɛ bɛdi ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Anaa ɛmɔ kenngale ye wɔ mmeraa nanu kyɛ, odwu homeda, na asɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ asɔre awuro ne bu homeda naso a, bɛyɛlle bɔne? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɔ ɔte piri tra asɔre awuro ne wɔ wa. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Sɔ dwirɛ he: ‘Mekuro anwunvoin, ɔtte afɔleɛ’ ne, sɛ ɛmɔte yebo a, ahaa bɔ edwirɛ nne ye nwo ne, ɛmɔ ngobu ye fɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ofikyɛ Sona awa ne yeɛ ɔte homeda ne wura ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu fili berɛ hɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />na né biaa bie wɔ berɛ bɔ ye sa kõ awu. Na bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne banya edwirɛ bafa babɔ ye sommoɛ ne, bɛbisale ye kyɛ, “Mmeraa maa atee kyɛ bɛsa ebie anwonyerɛ homeda?” <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie le boan kõ, na ɔkɔtɔ bɔen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kumaa.”</char></note> nu homeda a, ɔngɔsɔ ye nu ngɔye ye anaa? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Nakoso, sona nwo hia koraa tra boan! Yeti mmeraa ma atee kyɛ yɛkora yɛyɛ nikye pa homeda.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Yeti ɔha hyirele biaa ne kyɛ: “Tengyɛ wɔ sa nanu.” Ɔtengyɛle nu, na ye sa ne yɛle kama te kyɛ kõhene. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Yeɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ fite hɔle aluo dɔ bɛɛbɔle ye nwo porɛ, né bɛpena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhu ye ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yesu nwuni ye sɔ ne, ofili berɛ hɔle. Mmeni pee lili ye si, na ɔsale bɛ mukoraati anwonyerɛ, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />nakoso, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ bɛkyire ebiala. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ diifoɛ Isaiah hane ne wale nu kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Nea, m'akoaa bɔ maye ye ne ɛhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Bɔ medɔ ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">na male ye mato nu ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ngohwie me honhom ngogua ye so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">na ɔkɔha atɛn tenenee nwo dwirɛ kohyire maen-maen ne.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ɔne ebiala nngɔhõ, na ɔngɔ teɛtea nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Na bɛngɔte ye konvi wɔ dwaaso.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Elemmire bɔ wayɛ fanga-fanga ne, ɔngɔbu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Na kanea nyamaa bɔ ɔsɔ wusi-wusi ne, ɔngɔnua ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">kodwu kyɛ atɛn tenenee kɔwa nekaa biala ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ye dumaa nu yeɛ maen-maen ne konya anidasoɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Bɛfale biaa bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so bɛbrɛle Yesu, né ye nye asi, na ne ɔngora dwudwo. Na ɔsale biaa ne anwonyerɛ maa ɔdwudwole, na osa nwuni nikye. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ɔyɛle mmenia ne nwanwa, na bɛbisale kyɛ: “Aa! Nná David awa ne ɛhe?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Nakoso Farisifoɛ nemɔ tele ɛhe ne, bɛhane kyɛ, “Sɔ akoaa he, Beelsebub<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Beelsebul.”</char></note> bɔ ɔte sunzummɔne nemɔ panyi ne, ye tumi yeɛ ɔfa tu sunzummɔne ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Onwuni b'adwene ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ahennie biala bɔ ɔne ye nwo kõ ne, ogu; na kuro anaa awuro biala bɔ ɔne ye nwo kõ ne, ɔbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Sɔ ala yeɛ sɛ Satan tu Satan a, wadwɔso watia ye nwo, yeti ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ye ahennie ahora agyina? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Na sɛ Beelsebub tumi yeɛ mefa metu sunzummɔne a, ye de tumi beni yeɛ ɛmɔ mmaa nemɔ fa tu bɛ ɔ? Ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛkobu ɛmɔ atɛn ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Nakoso, sɛ Nyameɛ honhom yeɛ mefa metu sunzummɔne a, ye de Nyameɛ ahennie ne asã ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Na ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ebie ahora ahɔ kwabranoa bie awuro waafa ye nningyein? Sana odi moa kyekye kwabranoa ne, kora ne wahora wasesa ye nningyein ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Ebiala bɔ ɔbboka me so ne, ɔdwɔso tia me, na ebiala bɔ ɔne me mmoaboa ye noa ne, ɔbɔ sande. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Yeti, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛkɔfa bɔne ne mmusue dwirɛ biala bɛkɔhyɛ sona, nakoso mmusue dwirɛ bɔ otia honhom ne de, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ebiala bɔ odwudwo tia sona Awa ne, bɛkɔfa bɛkɔhyɛ ye, nakoso bɔ odwudwo tia honhom krongron ne de, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ ye lle, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ ye wɔ ewiase he, anaa bɔ ɔba nanu.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Sɛ ɛmɔ kɔmaa bakaa ne kɔyɛ bakaa pa, na ye mmaa ne ayɛ pa a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ; na sɛ ɛmɔ kɔmaa ɔkɔyɛ bakaa tɛɛ, na ye mmaa ne koso ayɛ tɛɛ a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ. Ofikyɛ bakaa ne mmaa ne yeɛ ɔmaa bɛnwu bakaa horɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Ɛkyerebene mmaa mɔ, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ɛmɔ ahora baha edwirɛ pa, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔte abɔnefoɛ ɔ? Ofikyɛ bɔ wabu so wɔ ebie ahone nu ne, ɛhene yeɛ noa ne ka ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Sona pa fi nningyein pa bɔ waboɔboa ye noa wɔ y'ahone nu ne da nningyein pa ali; ná nnipa-bɔneniɛ fi nningyein tɛɛ bɔ waboɔboa ye noa nanu da nningyein tɛɛ ali. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, edwirɛ bɔ mvasoɛ nne so biala bɔ sona kɔha ne, atemmuda ne, okobu ye nwo ngondaa. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ noa nu dwirɛ yeɛ bɛkogyina so bɛkobu ɛmɔ bem, na ɛmɔ noa nu dwirɛ yeɛ bɛkogyina so bɛkobu ɛmɔ fɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Yeɛ atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ ne biemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yɛpena kyɛ ɛyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bie maa yɛnea.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ mmerɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ”</char></note> abɔnefoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye agyaa ne pena nzɛngyerɛneɛ, nakoso bɛngonya bie, sana diifoɛ Yona deɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ná kyɛbɔ Yona lili bonsu kunu ɛlɛsa, eyia ne kɔngɔen ne, sɔ ala yeɛ sona Awa ne koso koli aseɛ kunu ɛlɛsa, eyia ne kɔngɔen ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Atemmuda ne, Ninewifoɛ ne mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> ne kɔdwɔso, na bɛkobu mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne fɔ, ofikyɛ Yona dwirɛ ne maa bɛsakrale. Nakoso, bɔ ɔtra Yona wɔ wa. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ngwan dɔ hemaa ne né mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nea 12:41 bo berɛ dwirɛ ne.</char></note> ne kɔdwɔso wɔ atemmuo nu, na okobu bɛ fɔ. Ofikyɛ ofili aseɛ ne noa dɔ ootiele Solomon nyanza, nakoso nea, bɔ ɔtra Solomon wɔ wa.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Sɛ sunzummɔne fi ebie nu a, okyini ɛtii so pena nekaa bɔ ɔkɔtena ɔ, nakoso onnya bie. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Afei ɔka kyɛ, ‘Ngosa ngɔhɔ nekaa bɔ mvi mmale ne.’ Na ɔkɔwa ne, né ebiala nne berɛ, na baprapra berɛ kama, basiesie nu. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Afei ɔkɔfa honhom nzoo bɔ bɛ ti anu yɛ se tra ye boka ye nwo so, ná baatena berɛ. Afei sɔ sona ne asetena ne sɛkye koraa tra daa deɛ ne. Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔto mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu ne mmenia ne dwudwo ne, Ye maame ne oliema mmrienzua nemɔ wale aluo berɛ, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛne ye dwudwo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Yeti, ebie ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea, wɔ maame ne eliema mɔ gyi aluo dɔ, bɛpena kyɛ bɛne wɔ dwudwo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Nakoso, mmuayɛ bɔ Yesu fa mane ye yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Me maame yeɛ ole nwa, na nniema yeɛ ole mwamɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ɔfale ye sa hyirele ye asuafoɛ naso hane kyɛ, “Nea, me maame ne nniema mɔ yeɛ bɛwɔ wa ne. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔ me baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne kuro ne, ɔte nniema brienzua, nniema brasua, ne me maame.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Sɔ kyẽa ne, Yesu fili awuro, na ɔɔtenane ɛpo ne noa. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Na mmeni pee wale berɛ bɛɛpɛle ye nwo beyiale, yeti ɔfo tenane ɛlɛen bie nu, na mmenia ne koso tenane ɛpo ne noa. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Na ɔfale mvandoho hane edwirɛ pee hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Kuaniɛ bie hɔle kyɛ ɔkwaagua <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔkwaapete”</char></note> ɛmo; <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ogua ne, ebie guale atee noa, na nnomaa susole. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ebie koso guale nyɔboɛ so, né nnɛterɛ pee nne berɛ. Yeti ofifili, nakoso ɔnate kyɛ nnɛterɛ pee nne berɛ nati, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />eyia fitele ne, ɔyerale ye, na ɔnate kyɛ olle ndii nati, owuli. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ebie guale mmowie nu, na mmowie ne nyi miane ye. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Nakoso, ebie guale aseɛ pa so na osuli mmaa, ebie sule 100, ebie sule 60, yeɛ ebie sule 30. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Bɔ ole asoɛ bɔ ɔkɔfa kotie ne, ma otie.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛfa mvandoho dwudwo kyire bɛ ne?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ de bafa bama ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte anwuro Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea nabo, nakoso bɛ de, bɛffa bɛmanne bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ebiala bɔ ole bie ne, bɛkɔfa pee bɛkɔboka ye so, na okonya ye maa okobu so. Nakoso bɔ olle bie ne de, bɔ ole ye ne po, bɛkole bɛkofi ye sa nu. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ mefa mvandoho medwudwo mekyire bɛ ne, ofikyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">‘Bɛnea po a, bɛnea ye mbaen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">Na sɛ bɛte po a, bɛte ye mbaen, bɛnde ye bo.’<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Bɛ yeɛ diifoɛ Isaiah hyɛle bɛ nwo ngɔm kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Ɛtelɛ de ɛmɔ kɔte, nakoso ɛmɔngɔte yebo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">Ɛneanɛ de ɛmɔ kɔnea, nakoso ɛmɔ ngonwu ye.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ofikyɛ mmenia hemɔ ahone atiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na bɛfa bɛ so betie ye mbaen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">Bakata bɛ nye, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bɛngɔfa bɛ nye bɛngonwu ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ná bafa bɛ so bate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ná bafa b'ahone bate yebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">na basakra b'adwene maa masa b'anwonyerɛ.’ <verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, anigye yeɛ ole ɛmɔ nye, ofikyɛ onwu nikye, ɔne ɛmɔ so, ofikyɛ ɔte dwirɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, né adiifoɛ ne ateneneefoɛ pee pena kyɛ bɛnwu bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye ne, nakoso bannwu ye, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛte bɔ ɛmɔte ne, nakoso bande.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Afei, ɛmɔtie bɔ kuaniɛ nanwo mvandoho ne kyire ɔ: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Sɛ ebie te ahennie nanwo dwirɛ ne, ná wande yebo a, ɔbɔnefoɛ ne basesa fi ye ahone nu, ɛhe yeɛ ole bɔ oguale atee noa ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Na bɔ oguale nyɔboɛ so ne de, yeɛ ole bɔ ɔte edwirɛ ne a, ɔfa anigye dɛ́ to nu; <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />nakoso ɔnate kyɛ olle ndii biala nati, ɔtena berɛ mmerɛ kaa. Na edwirɛ nati, sɛ oyia ɔhaw anaa bɛtane ye nye a, ɔto ye sintidua ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Na bɔ oguale mmowie nu ne yeɛ ole bɔ ɔte edwirɛ ne a, asetena nu dadwene ne ahonyadeɛ bɔ ɔpena kyɛ onya ye ne mia edwirɛ ne, yeti onzu mmaa ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Na bɔ oguale aseɛ pa nu ne yeɛ ole bɔ ɔtele edwirɛ ne, na ɔtele yebo ne. Ye de osu mmaa, ebie su 100, ebie su 60, yeɛ ebie su 30. ”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Afei, osa yɛle mvandoho foforɛ kyɛ: “Anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ biaa bie bɔ oluale mmaa pa wɔ ye boo nu. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Mmerɛ bɔ ebiala ala ne, ye tamfo bie wale, na ooluale ndire<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔkɔhora kɔyɛ ndire bie te kyɛ ngyɛ-ngyɛ-ma</char></note> frale hwiit ne, yeɛ ɔhɔle ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Hwiit ne nyini ná osuli ne, ndire ne koso yele ye nwo ali. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Yeti ye ngoaa ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Yɛ wura, nná mmaa pa yeɛ eluale ye wɔ boo nanu ɔ? Ye de, ndire he fi nisua?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, ‘Ɔtamfo bie yeɛ ɔyɛle sɔ ne.’ Yeti, ngoaa ne bisale ye kyɛ, ‘Ɛpena kyɛ yɛtutu ndire ne anaa?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Daabi, sɛ ɛmɔ tutu ndire ne kesaalae a, annea a né ɛmɔ atutu hwiit ne baboka ye. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Yeti ɛmɔma ye mukoraati bɔnu nyi oodwu mmerɛ bɔ bɛkɔpɛ ne, sɛ bɛpɛ a, ngɔha ngohyire apaafoɛ ne kyɛ, bɛli moa bɛboɔboa ndire ne noa, na bɛkyekye bɛyera ye, beyie a, né baboɔboa hwiit ne noa bagua me pata naso.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Osa yɛle mvandoho foforɛ kyɛ: “Anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ sinapi mmaa bɔ ebie fale, na ooluale ye wɔ ye boo nu. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ɔwɔ nu, ye yeɛ ɔte kaa wɔ aba mukoraati nu ɔ, nakoso sɛ onyi a, ɔyɛ piri tra atɔsodeɛ bɔ bɛdua namukoraati, na ɔbayɛ bakaa maa ewienu nnomaa tena-tena ye sa naso.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Osa yɛle mvandoho foforɛ kyɛ: “Anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ yiste<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yiste te nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛfra esam maa otu.</char></note> bɔ maame bie fa frale esam olonka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek: Seah — lita 7.33</char></note> mbiri nza maa ye mukoraati tuli ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Mvandoho yeɛ Yesu fa hane sɔ dwirɛ he amukoraati hyirele mmenia ne ɔ. Nahorɛ nu, wandwudwo wangyire bɛ bɔ mvandoho bokka so ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ adiifoɛ ne hane ne wale nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Mvandoho yeɛ ngɔfa ngɔ dwudwo ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Na nningyein bɔ wafea fi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle ewiase ne, ngɔha.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Afei Yesu guale mmenia ne atee, na ɔhɔle awuro. Yeɛ asuafoɛ ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyirekyire ndire nanwo mvandoho nanu kyire yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Bɔ oluale mmaa pa ne yeɛ ole sona Awa ne; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />ɛboo ne yeɛ ole wiase ne. Mmaa pa ne yeɛ ole ahennie ne mmaa ne, na ndire ne yeɛ ole ɔbɔnefoɛ ne mmaa ne. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Yeɛ ɔtamfo ne yeɛ ole Abɔnzam. Mmerɛ bɔ bɛpɛle ne yeɛ ole wiase ne awieɛ mmerɛ ne. Na abɔfo nemɔ yeɛ bɛpɛle ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Na kyɛbɔ bɛboɔboale ndire ne noa bɛyerale ye ne, sɔ ala yeɛ wiase awieɛ mmerɛ ne kɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Sona awa ne kɔsoma ye abɔfo, na bɛkɔboɔboa nikye biala bɔ ɔto sintidua, ɔne abɔnefoɛ mukoraati noa kofi ye ahennie nanu. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Na bɛkogyi bɛ bɛkogua fonoo bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru nanu. Ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛkosu na bɛ anwose bɛ gye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Na ateneneefoɛ ne de, bɛkɔta te kyɛ eyia wɔ bɛ Baba Ahennie nanu. Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Anwuro Ahennie ne te kyɛ agudeɛ bie bɔ owura ɛboo bie nu, bɔ ebie nwuni ye ná ɔfa feale ɔ; na ye fɛɛ bɔ ɔyɛ ye nati, ɔtɔnene ye nwo nningyein mukoraati tɔle sɔ aseɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Afei Anwuro Ahennie ne te kyɛ dwadiniɛ bie bɔ otu atee kɔpena agudeɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Afire.”</char></note> pa. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Onwuni agudeɛ bie bɔ ɔsom bo paa ne, ɛberɛ ala ɔɔtɔnene bɔ ole ye mukoraati fa tɔle sɔ agudeɛ pa ne.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Afei koso, anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ nɛt bɔ bɛto bɛguale ɛpo nu maa ɔhyele egyein ahoroɛ pee. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Oyili ne, bɛtwetwe bɛwale ɛpo ne noa, na bɛtenane ase bɛyeyele pa ne bɛguale nikye nu, na bɔ ɔttemaye ne de, bɛgyi bɛguale. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Sɔ ala yeɛ awieɛ mmerɛ ne kɔyɛ ɔ. Abɔfo nemɔ kɔyeye abɔnefoɛ nemɔ kofi ateneneefoɛ nemɔ nu, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na bɛkogyi bɛ bɛkogua fonoo bɔ ɔsɔ buru-buru nanu, ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛkosu na bɛ anwose bɛ gye ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />“Nnaa ɛmɔte ɛhe amukoraati bo?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yoo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Yeɛ ye koso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ye sɔ de a, kyerɛkyerɛniɛ biala bɔ bahyirehyire ye anwuro Ahennie nanwo nikye ne, ɔte kyɛ efiewura bie bɔ ɔye nningyein monɛ ne daa fi sua bɔ ɔfa ye nningyein gua nu nanu ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu yiele sɔ mvandoho he mukoraati ne, ofili berɛ hɔle. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Na odwuli ye bɔbɔ ye kuro ne, ohyirehyirele mmenia ne wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, ná bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ. Yeti bɛbisale kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ akoaa he nyane sɔ nyanza ne tumi bɔ ɔfa yɛ anwanwadeɛ ne ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />“Nná kapentaniɛ ne awa ne ɛhe? Nná ye maame yeɛ ole Mary, na nná oliema mmrienzua yeɛ ole Yakobo, Yosef, Simon ne Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na oliema mmrasua koso, nná yɛne bɛ yeɛ ɛwɔ wa ne? Ye de, nisua yeɛ onyane ɛhe amukoraati fili ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Yeti ɔyɛle sintidua mane bɛ. Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Diifoɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ole anuonyam wɔ ye kuro ne ye awuro ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Na gyidie bɔ bɛlle ye nati, wanyɛ anwanwadeɛ pee wɔ berɛ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Herode bɔ ɔte manzini soafoɛ ne tele Yesu nwo dwirɛ, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye ngoaa nemɔ kyɛ, “Yohane Suboniɛ yeɛ watingye wafi ewue nu ne! Yeti yeɛ wanya tumi bɔ ɔfa yɛ anwanwadeɛ sɔ ne.” <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Herode aliemaa Filipo aye Herodia ti, né Herode ahye Yohane akyekye ye ato prizin. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Ofikyɛ daa né Yohane ka kyire ye kyɛ: “Mmeraa mma atee kyɛ egya ye.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Yeti né Herode pena kyɛ oku Yohane, nakoso ne osuro mmenia ne, ofikyɛ né bɛnwu Yohane kyɛ ɔte diifoɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Nakoso, kyẽa bɔ Herode di ye awoda ne, Herodia awa brasua gole maa ɔyɛle ye nyemene paa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />yeti, ɔhane ndaen kyɛ, bɔ okobisa biala ne, ɔkɔfa kɔma ye. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Yeɛ abayaa ne maame tutu guale ye so anu alaa maa ɔhane kyɛ: “Fa Yohane Suboniɛ ti to plɛte so ma me.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle ɔhene ne yea, nakoso ndaen bɔ waha, ɔne mmenia bɔ né bɛwɔ berɛ nati, ɔhane kyɛ bɛyɛ bɔ wabisa ne bɛma ye, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />yeti ɔsomane maa bɛɛpɛle Yohane ti wɔ prizin dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Na bɛfale ye ti ne bɛtole plɛte so bɛbrɛle abayaa ne, na ye koso ɔfa ɔɔmane ye maame. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Afei, Yohane asuafoɛ ne wale bɛɛfale fuin ne, ná beesiele ye. Yeɛ bɛɛbɔle Yesu amaneɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu tele Yohane dwirɛ ne, ɔfale ɛlɛen fili berɛ kyɛ ɔkwaawura nekaa bɔ ɛberɛ te dinn. Nakoso mmenia ne tele ye nwo dwirɛ, na bɛfili nguro nanu bɛfale ase bɛhɔle nekaa bɔ ɔwɔ ne. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ofili ɛleɛn nanu dwuli bɔ onwuni mmenia ne, bɛyɛle ye anwunvo na ɔsale bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ ne anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ, yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛwa ate ye nwo, na aleɛ asa. Gua mmenia ne atee ma bɛhɔ nnamue nemɔ nu bɛɛtɔ aleɛ bie bɛli.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Nakoso, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ maa bɛkɔ, ɛmɔma bɛ nikye ma bɛli.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ, “Paanoo nnu ne egyein nyɔ pɛ yeɛ ɔwɔ wa ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfa bɛbrɛ me.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele mmenia nemɔ kyɛ bɛtena-tena nzenzaen naso. Na ɔfale paanoo nnu ne egyein nyɔ ne, na ɔneane anwuro hyirale so, na obubule nu fa mane asuafoɛ nemɔ, na bɛ koso bɛfa bɛmane mmenia nemɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Yeti, bɛlili maa bɛ ko yili, na bɛsesale ye boso kɛndɛn 12 tɛkyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Mmrienzua 5,000 yeɛ bɛlili ɔ, bannga mmrasua ne ngwalaa bammoka so.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ɛberɛ nala, Yesu maa asuafoɛ nemɔ fole ɛleɛn ne hɔle nzue ne si dɔ, yeɛ oguale mmenia nemɔ atee ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Oguale bɛ atee yiele ne, ɔhɔle bokaa naso, na ye ngome oowurale dɔ bɔle mbaeɛ. Né aleɛ asa, nakoso ye ngome yeɛ ne owura berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɛleɛn ne wɔ ɛpo ne afia, na né ɔmbingye aseɛ koraa. Né asorɔkye ne amaa bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ, ofikyɛ ne mvrama ne bɔ yia bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Na odwuli alobahene ne, ɔfale nzue naso wale bɛ nwo berɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ nwuni kyɛ ɔnate ɛpo naso ne, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, gya yɛkye nnaleɛ!” Na esuronyi ti, né bɛteɛtea nu. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ɛberɛ ala yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔha ɛmɔ ahone bɛto ɛmɔ kunu, me ɛne, nnɛmɔ suro.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Yeɛ Petro hane kyɛ: “Awurade, sɛ wɔ ahɔ a, ka ma mva nzue naso mmra wɔ nwo berɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu hane kyɛ, “Bra.” Yeɛ Petro dwu fili ɛlɛen nanu ɔ, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔnate nzue naso kɔ Yesu nwo dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nakoso onwuni kyɛ asorɔkye ne noa ayɛ se ne, ye kunu tele ye, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔme, yeɛ ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Awurade, dɛ́ me!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ndɛ nala, Yesu tengyɛle ye sa sɔle ye nu, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ bɔ wɔ gyidie te kaa, nzuati yeɛ ɛmaa w'adwene nu yɛle wɔ naa ne?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Na bɛfole ɛlɛen ne, asorɔkye ne yɛle dinn. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ná bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ ɛleɛn nanu ne kotole ye, na bɛhane kyɛ, “Amba, wɔ yeɛ ɛle Nyameɛ Awa ne!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Na bɛpɛle nzue ne bɛwale Genesaret. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne nwuni Yesu ne, bɛsoma mmenia maa bɛɛbɔle amaneɛ wɔ mandanu berɛ mukoraati, na bɛfale bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ namukoraati bɛbrɛle ye. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Na bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔma bɛfa bɛ sa bɛha ye atadeɛ ne noa mbaen, na bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle sɔ ne nwo tɔle bɛ koraa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Na Farisifoɛ ne atwerɛfoɛ ne bie fili Yerusalem wale Yesu berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Nzuati yeɛ w'asuafoɛ nemɔ bu yɛ nana mɔ amammerɛ so ne? Nzuati yeɛ bɛdidi a, bɛnnwunzi bɛ sa ne?” <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ amammerɛ ti, ɛmɔbu Nyameɛ ahyɛdeɛ so ne? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ hane kyɛ, ‘Fa nidie ma wɔ baba ne wɔ maame,’ na ‘Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha edwirɛ tɛɛ kotia ye maame anaa ye baba ne, odikyɛ bɛku ye.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Nakoso, ɛmɔka kyɛ: ‘Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha kohyire ye maame anaa ye baba kyɛ: “Nikye biala bɔ nne ye, bɔ ahaa ekonya so mvasoɛ ne, ɔte akyɛdeɛ bɔ mafa mama Nyameɛ” ne, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />nnɛmaa obu ye maame anaa ye baba koraa.’ Ɛmɔ amammerɛ ti, ɛmɔ mva Nyameɛ mmeraa ne bɛnyɛ hwee. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Nyaatwomfoɛ, yeti yeɛ Isaiah hyɛle ɛmɔ nwo ngɔm kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Maen he fa bɛ noa mbaen yeɛ bɛdi me ni ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">nakoso b'ahone de, ɔnne me nwo koraa.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Bɛsõ me mbaen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">ofikyɛ sona ahyɛdeɛ yeɛ bekyirekyire ɔ.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yeti, Yesu frɛle mmenia ne wale ye nwo berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔtie, na ɛmɔte yebo kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />‘Nná bɔ ɔkɔ sona noa nu yeɛ ogua ye nwo fiɛ ɔ, mmom bɔ ofi ye noa nu ba ne.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ ne wale ye nwo berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɔ ɛhane ne, ɛse kyɛ wanyɛ Farisifoɛ nemɔ fɛ ne?”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔtole bɛ sintidua”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yeɛ ye koso ɔhane kyɛ: “Bakaa biala bɔ nná me anwuro Baba yeɛ oluale ne, yebo kɔtutu. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Nnɛmɔ tɛ bɛ so! Bɛkyire mmenia atee, nakoso bɛ nye asi. Na sɛ anyesiniwaaniɛ kyire anyesiniwaaniɛ atee a, bɛ munyɔ namukoraati koogua kumaa nu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Kyirekyire sɔ dwirɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mvandoho”</char></note> nanu kyire yɛ ee.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu bisale kyɛ, “Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnde ye bo?” <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />“Ɛmɔnze kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ ɔkɔ yɛ noa nu ne, ɔkogua yɛ kunu, na afei waagua ɛyaen nu? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Nakoso nningyein bɔ ofi yɛ noa nu ba ne, ofi y'ahone nu, na ɛhene yeɛ ogua sona nwo fiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ, ahone nanu yeɛ adwemmɔne, awudie, agyaa sɛkyelɛ, adwaman, awie, adanzewia, ne mmusue fi ba ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Sɔ nningyein he yeɛ ogua sona nwo fiɛ ɔ, na sɛ ebie didi na wannwunzi ye sa de a, ɛhene ngua ye nwo fiɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu fili berɛ ne, ɔhɔle Tiro ne Sidon mandanu dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Na Kanaaniɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Foinikeniɛ.”</char></note> brasua bie bɔ ofi mandanu berɛ wale ye berɛ, na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Ao me Wura, David Awa, nwu me anwunvo. Sunzummɔne ha mma brasua paa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Nakoso, Yesu andɛ ye so. Yeti ye asuafoɛ nemɔ srɛle ye kyɛ: “Ma ɔhɔ, ofikyɛ osu teɛtea nu di yɛ si.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Na ɔhane kyɛ: “Israel awuro mmoan bɔ bamini ne ngome, yeɛ bɛsomane me bɛ berɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Yeɛ brasua ne buli ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Awurade, boka me!” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Na Yesu koso ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Ɔttemaye kyɛ ɛkɔfa ngwalaa paanoo kɔma ngyea.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ye koso, ɔhane kyɛ, “Yoo, Awurade, mmom ngyea ne di bɔ wafi bɛ wuramɔ tɛbulu naso wagua ase ne.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Baa brasua, wɔ gyidie te piri! Ɔyɛ berɛ ma wɔ, kyɛbɔ ɛpena ne.”<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu fili berɛ ne, ɔhɔle Galilea po ne noa, mmerɛ bɔ ɔfolo bokaa ne, ɔtenane ase. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Yeɛ mmeni pee wale ye berɛ, na bɛfale apakye, anyesiniwaafoɛ, bɛ bɔ babubu, ɛmumu, ne ayarefoɛ pee beeguale ye gya bo, na ɔsale bɛ anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Na mmenia nemɔ nwuni kyɛ ɛmumu dwudwo, apakye nate, na anyesiniwaafoɛ nwu nikye ne, ɔyɛle bɛ nwanwa, na bɛyele Israel Nyameɛ ne ayɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yeɛ Yesu frɛle ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mmenia nemɔ nwo yɛ me anwunvo, ɛlɛsa yeɛ bafa batena me nwo wa ɔ; ná bɛlle hwee bɔ bɛkoli ɔ. Menguro kyɛ bɛfa ɛhɔen bɛkɔ, annea a, né bapɛ bafi atee nu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɛwa ate ye nwo, na nisua paa yeɛ yɛkwaanya paanoo bɔ ɔkɔso mmenia somaa he ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Paanoo nyɛɛ yeɛ ɛmɔle ye wɔ berɛ ɔ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Nzoo, yeɛ egyein kaa bie.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ bɛtena-tena ɛserɛ naso. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Na ɔlɛle paanoo nzoo ne egyein ne, yeɛ ɔlale ase bubule nu ɔ. Na ɔfa mane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na bɛ koso bɛfa bɛmane mmenia ne. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Na bɛ mukoraati bɛlili maa bɛ ko yili; na asuafoɛ nemɔ sesale ye boso ne, benyane kɛndɛn nzoo dɛen. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Mmrienzua 4,000 yeɛ bɛlili ɔ, banga mmrasua ne ngwalaa ne bammoka so. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Yesu guale mmenia nemɔ atee ne, ɔtenane ɛleɛn nu hɔle Magadan mandanu dɔ.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ ne wale Yesu berɛ, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛsɔ ye bɛnea, yeti bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ ɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ofi anwuro ma bɛnea. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ odwu nnɔsoa a, ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Ewienu kɔte, ofikyɛ ewienu ayɛ kɔɔ;’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />na ngyerɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔka kyɛ: ‘Ewienu kɔyɛ frɔlɔɔ maa nzue kɔtɔ, ofikyɛ ewienu ayɛ kɔɔ, na nzue ne amuna.’ Ɛmɔ kora bɛkyire ewienu tebea bo, nakoso mmerɛ nanwo nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne de, ɛmɔnze. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Ɛnɛ mmerɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> abɔnefoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye agyaa ne pena nzɛngyerɛneɛ, nakoso bɛngonya nzɛngyerɛneɛ biala, sana Yona deɛ ne.” Yeɛ ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ hɔle ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Bɛkɔ nzue ne si dɔ ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wora fili kyɛ bɛkɔfa paanoo. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Na Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ mmɔka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yiste. Ɔte nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛfra esam maa otu.”</char></note> nwo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Na bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛdwene edwirɛ nanwo, yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Sãa yamva paanoo biala yamma.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu nwuni ngɔmmɔ bɔ bɛbɔ ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie te kaa, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔdwene paanoo bɔ ɛmɔ amva nanwo ne? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Ɛmɔnya bɛttele yebo? Ɛmɔngaye paanoo nnu bɔ mmenia 5,000 ne lili ne, ɔne ngɛndɛn dodoɔ bɔ ɛmɔ sesale ye wɔ yebo ne? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Anaa paanoo nzoo bɔ mmenia 4,000 lili, ɔne ngɛndɛn dodoɔ bɔ ɛmɔ sesale ye wɔ yebo ne? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔnnwu ye kyɛ, nná paanoo nwo dwirɛ yeɛ meka ne? Mmom, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ mmɔka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yiste, ɔte nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛfra esam maa otu.”</char></note> nwo.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛtele yebo kyɛ, nná mmɔka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nea 16:12 bo berɛ dwirɛ ne.</char></note> bɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ paanoo nanwo dwirɛ yeɛ ɔka ɔ, mmom Farisifoɛ ne Sadukifoɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ yeɛ ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu wale Kaesarea Filipi mandanu berɛ ne, obisale ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Mmenia adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ, sona Awa ne te nwa?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bɛyele ye noa kyɛ: “Ebiemɔ nwa Yohane Suboniɛ ne, ebiemɔ koso nwa Elia, yeɛ bɛ bɔ baha ne nwa Yeremia, anaa adiifoɛ bɔ baha ne bie.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yeɛ obisale kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnwa nde sona beni?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Yeɛ Simon Petro hane kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Kristo ne, Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne awa ne.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yona awa Simon, anigye yeɛ ole wɔ! Ofikyɛ nná anwoɔnaen ne mogya yeɛ ɔmaa ɛnwuni ɛhe ɔ, mmom me Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne yeɛ ɔlale ye ali hyirele wɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Afei meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, wɔ yeɛ ɛle Petro, na nyɔbotaen he aso yeɛ ngosi m'asafo ngosie ɔ, na asieleɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ewue.”</char></note> ngɔhora nngoli so ngunim. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ngɔfa anwuro ahennie ne nzafoa ngɔma wɔ, na bɔ ɛkɔkyekye ye wɔ aseɛ he aso ne, bɛkɔkyekye ye wɔ anwuro, na bɔ ɛkɔsangye ye wɔ aseɛ he aso ne, bɛkɔsangye ye wɔ anwuro.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Yeɛ ɔbɔle bɛ noa kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛka bɛkyire ebiala kyɛ ye yeɛ ole Kristo ne.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, Yesu hyɛle yebo ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ, odikyɛ ɔkɔ Yerusalem konwu amaneɛ wɔ mbanyi ne, sɔfo mbanyi, ne atwerɛfoɛ ne sa nu, na bɛku ye, na kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne, ɔkɔtingye. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Yeɛ Petro fale ye hɔle ahameɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo hwili ye nyunu kyɛ: “Awurade, ka edwirɛ pa ma wɔ nwo, ɛhe ngɔwa wɔ so lle.” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Na Yesu kakyile ye si hyirele Petro, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fi berɛ kɔ dɔ, Satan! Ɛte sintidua ma me. Ofikyɛ ɛndwene Nyameɛ adwene, sona adwene yeɛ ɔwɔ wɔ ti anu ɔ.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sona adwene yeɛ ɛdwene ɔ.”</char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ odi me si a, ma ɔpa ye nwo si, ɔfa ye asɛnnua, na ɔhɔ so li me si. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔbɔ ye ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> nwo waen ne, okofi ye sa, nakoso ebiala bɔ me ti ye ngoa kofi ye sa ne, ye sa kɔha ye. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Na sɛ ebie nya wiase ahonyadeɛ mukoraati, na ye ngoa fi ye sa a, mvasoɛ beni ye okonya ye ɔ? Na nzu yeɛ sona kɔhora kɔfa kɔsesa ye ngoa ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Sona Awa ne kɔwa ye Baba anuonyam nu bɔ abɔfo boka ye so, na okotua ebiala kerɛ, kyɛbɔ ye nneyɛɛ te ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nahorɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi wa ne bie wɔ berɛ a, bɛngɔwu, sana banwu kyɛ sona Awa ne awa ye ahennie nu kora.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ɛlɛsia si ne, Yesu fale Petro, Yakobo ne oliema Yohane bokale ye nwo so hɔle bokaa tendee bie so. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Ɔsesane ye nwo wɔ bɛ nyunu, ye nyunu tale te kyɛ eyia, na ye atadeɛ ne tale hyireinn te kyɛ kanea. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Na Mose ne Elia yele bɛ nwo ali wɔ berɛ, na né bɛne ye bɔ ngɔmmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Awurade, ɔte pa paa kyɛ yɛwɔ wa ɔ. Sɛ ɛkuro a, ngosi <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nza wɔ wa, wɔ deɛ kõ, Mose deɛ kõ, yeɛ Elia deɛ kõ.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Petro gu so odwudwo ne, munungum hyɛn-hyɛn bie katale bɛ so, na konviɛ bie fili munungum nanu wale kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole mma bɔ medɔ ye, na male ye mato nu ne, ɛmɔtie ye.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ tele ɛhe ne, esuronyi hane bɛ, na bɛfale bɛ nyunu bɛbutule ase. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yeɛ Yesu wale bɛ nwo berɛ, na ɔsɔle bɛ nu hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔdwɔso, nnɛmɔ suro.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Na bɛdwɔsole ne, Yesu ngome yeɛ bɛnwuni ye ɔ, banwu ebiala kõ.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Na bɛtoro bokaa ne bɛba ne, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ ka anisoadehu he anwo dwirɛ bɛkyire ebiala kodwu kyɛ sona awa ne kotingye kofi ewue nu ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ ka kyɛ, odikyɛ Elia di moa ba ne?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu yele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Amba, Elia koli moa kɔwa, ná waatoto nningyein. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ Elia awa dada, nakoso bannwu ye, na bɔ bɛkuro biala yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛle ye ɔ. Na sɔ ala yeɛ sona Awa ne konwu amaneɛ wɔ bɛ sa nu ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ asuafoɛ ne nwuni kyɛ Yohane Suboniɛ nwo dwirɛ yeɛ ɔka ne.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Bɛwale mmenia nanu ne, baba bie wale Yesu berɛ, na obuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu hane kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Awurade, nwu mma ne anwunvo, ɔpɛ na anwonyerɛ ne teetee ye paa. Ɔtaa tɔ see ne nzue nu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Mvale ye mmerɛle w'asuafoɛ nemɔ, nakoso, bangora bannza ye anwonyerɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ɛnɛ mmerɛ mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> abɔnefoɛ bɔ bɛlle gyidie, mmerɛ nyɛɛ yeɛ mene ɛmɔ tena ɔ? Mmerɛ nyɛɛ yeɛ nya ɛmɔ nwo aboterɛ ɔ? Fa akwalaa ne bra.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yeɛ Yesu hwili sunzummɔne ne nyunu, na ofili akwalaa ne nu, na ɛberɛ ala ye nwo tɔle ye. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Yesi ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wale Yesu berɛ kokoanu, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ yangora sunzum ne tu ne?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ gyidie bɔ ɔte kaa nati ɔ. Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔle gyidie bɔ ye piri te kyɛ sinapi mmaa a, ahaa ɛmɔka bɛkyire bokaa he kyɛ, ‘Tu fi wa kɔ dɔ’ a, ɔkɔtu, ná nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔngɔyɛ yé ngɔma ɛmɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bdit">“Nakoso sɔ nikye he de, yebo kotu a, sana mbaeɛ ne akɔngyere.”</char> Nakoso sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔ bɔ wahyɛ paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne ɔnne nu. </note>—<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Bɛboale bɛ nwo noa wɔ Galilea ne, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɛkɔfa sona Awa ne bɛkowura mmenia sa <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />maa bɛkɔhu ye, na ɛlɛsa si ne, ɔkɔtingye.” Sɔ dwirɛ ne maa bɛ wora bɔle paa.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Bɛdwuli Kapernaum ne, bɛ bɔ bɛdide drakma nyɔ toɔ ne wale Petro berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne, otua drakma nyɔ toɔ ne anaa?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Yoo.” Petro wurale awuro berɛ ne, Yesu li moa bisale ye kyɛ: “Simon, enwu ye sɛ? Nwamɔ yeɛ odikyɛ aseɛ naso ahemvo ne de toɔ fi bɛ berɛ ɔ, bɛ mmaa, anaa ɛwɔfoɛ mɔ berɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petro hane kyɛ: “Ɛwɔfoɛ mɔ.” Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ye de nnaa mmaa nemɔ bokka so. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nakoso bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na yando ebiala sintidua ne, kɔto koaa wɔ ɛpo nanu. Egyein bɔ ɛkoli moa kɔhye ye ne, bukye ye noa nu, ekonwu dwetɛ sikaa. Ye bra, na fa batua yɛ munyɔ deɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wale Yesu berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔte piri wɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yeti, Yesu frɛle akwalaa kamba bie, na ɔfale ye gyinane bɛ afia, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔ anzakra banyɛ kyɛ akwalaa kamba he a, ɛmɔngɔhɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu lle. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase kyɛ akwalaa he ne, ye yeɛ ɔte piri paa wɔ anwuro Ahennie nanu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Na ebiala bɔ okole akwalaa kamba he me dumaa nu ne, wale me koso. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Nakoso, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔto ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa bɔ bɛle gyidie wɔ me nu nanu kõ sintidua ne, sɛ bɛfale nyɔboɛ kandinga bɔ bɛfa bɛtĩ hwiit bɛtole ye kɔme bɛgyili ye bɛtole ɛpo nu a, ahaa ɔte pa.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />“Sintidua ti, ewiase ne yaakɔ. Ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, sintidua kɔwa, nakoso sona bɔ ɔnate yeso kɔwa ne, ye yaakɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Sɛ wɔ sa kõ anaa wɔ gya kõ to wɔ sintidua a, pɛ na gyi to. Ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔyɛ apakye anaa bubuaniɛ kɔhɔ ngoa nu, tra kyɛ bɛkɔto wɔ nipadua namukoraati bɛkɔto see bɔ ɔsɔ daa nanu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Afei koso, sɛ wɔ nye kõ to wɔ sintidua a, tu na gyi to, ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔfa anyeɛ komapɛ kɔhɔ ngoa nu tra kyɛ ɛkɔfa wɔ nye nyɔ namukoraati kɔhɔ <char style="tl">Gehenna.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Ɛmɔnea yé na ɛmɔ ammu mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ po animtia, na meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ b'abɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne nwu me Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne nyunu daa. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="em">“Ofikyɛ sona Awa ne wale kyɛ ɔbaale bɛ bɔ bamini ne ngoa.”</char> Nakoso sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne nne nu.</note>— <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ sɛ? Sɛ ebie le mmoan 100 na bɛ nu kõ mini a, aso ɔngɔyakyi 99 ne wɔ bokaa naso ngɔhɔ ngɔpena kõ bɔ wamini ne? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Na sɛ onwu ye a, nahorɛ nu, meka mekyire ɛmɔ, ye nye gye boan kõ nanwo tra 99 bɔ bɛmminini ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne nguro kyɛ mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ po komini ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Afei, sɛ eliema yɛ wɔ bɔne a, wɔ ngome kɔ ye berɛ, na ma onwu ye mvomsoɛ. Sɛ otie wɔ a, anya eliema. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Nakoso sɛ wandie wɔ a, fa sona kõ anaa nyɔ boka wɔ nwo so na ɛmɔhɔ ye berɛ, na wamaa mmenia nyɔ anaa nza ali edwirɛ nanwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Sɛ wandie bɛ a, bɔ asafo ne amaneɛ, na sɛ wandie asafo ne a, bu ye kyɛ ɔte maen-maen nuniɛ, anaa ebie bɔ odidɛ toɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Na nahorɛ dwirɛ bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔ ɛmɔ akyekye ye wɔ aseɛ he aso ne, bakyekye ye wɔ anwuro, na bɔ ɛmɔ asangye ye sɔ aseɛ he aso ne, basangye ye wɔ anwuro. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Nahorɛ, mesa meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔ nu nyɔ yɛ adwene kõ wɔ aseɛ he aso kyɛ bɛkobisa nikye bie bɔ ye nwo hia a, ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne kɔyɛ kɔma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ofikyɛ nekaa biala bɔ mmenia nyɔ anaa nza koyia nu wɔ me dumaa nu ne, né nwɔ berɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Yeɛ Petro wale ye berɛ, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Nniema yɛ me bɔne pɛn nyɛɛ a, yeɛ mva ngyɛ ye ɔ? Pɛn nzoo anaa?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ, “Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, nná pɛn nzoo, mmom aburaso ne nzoo!” <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aburaso ahoroɛ nzoo” (70×7)</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Yeti, anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ ɔhene bie bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔne ye ngoaa bu ngondaa. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ɔhyɛle yebo ne, bɛfale biaa bie bɛwale, né ɔma kerɛ talɛnde 10,000.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ dɛnare 60,000,000.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nakoso, ne ɔngɔhora sɔ kerɛ ne tua lle, yeti ye wura ne hane kyɛ bɛtɔne ye, ɔye, ye mmaa mɔ, ne nikye biala bɔ ole ye, na bɛfa betua kerɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yeɛ akoaa ne buli ndwerɛ wɔ ye wura ne nyunu srɛle ye kyɛ: ‘Nya me nwo aboterɛ, na ngotua wɔ kerɛ namukoraati ngɔma wɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle ye wura ne anwunvo, yeti ɔfale kerɛ ne hyɛle ye, na ɔyakyile ye kyɛ ɔhɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Nakoso sɔ akoaa ne fili berɛ ne, onwuni ye mmango akoaa bie bɔ ɔma ye kerɛ dɛnare 100 pɛ, na ɔyerele ye, yeɛ omiane ye kɔme hane kyɛ: ‘Tua me kerɛ namukoraati ma me.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yeti, ye mmango akoaa ne buli ndwerɛ srɛle ye kyɛ, ‘Mesrɛ wɔ, nya me nwo aboterɛ, na ngotua wɔ kerɛ ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Nakoso, wande ye bo, yeti ɔhane kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛto prizin ma oodwu kyɛ okotua ye kerɛ ne kɔma ye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ye mmango nemɔ nwuni bɔ wasi ne, ɔyɛle bɛ yea paa, yeti bɛɛhane bɔ wasi namukoraati bɛhyirele bɛwura ne. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Yeɛ ye wura ne frɛle ye, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Wɔ, ɛtte sona pa!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Akoaa tɛɛ.”</char></note> Mmerɛ bɔ ɛsrɛle me ne, mamva wɔ kerɛ namukoraati mangyɛ wɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Nzuati yeɛ wɔ de anwu wɔ mmango akoaa ne anwunvo kyɛbɔ nwuni wɔ anwunvo ne?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Yeti ye wura ne fɛle yaa, na ɔfale ye mane bɛ bɔ bɛnea prizin berɛ ne, kyɛ bɛfa ye bɛto nu kodwu kyɛ okotua kerɛ namukoraati ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔ amvi ɛmɔ ahone nu bamva ɛmɔ mmango mɔ bɔne bangyɛ bɛ a, me Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne né ɛmɔ koli.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu hane edwirɛ hemɔ yiele ne, ofili Galilea, na ɔpɛle Yordan hɔle Yudea mandanu dɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mmeni pee lili ye si, na ɔsale bɛ mukoraati anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Yeɛ Farisifoɛ biemɔ wale ye berɛ, né b'adwene yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛbaasɔ ye bɛnea, yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Mmeraa ma atee kyɛ, ɛkora gyina nikye biala so yira ɛye?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yeɛ ɔyele bɛ noa kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ kenngale kyɛ, ahyɛaseɛ pɛɛ yeɛ bɔ ɔbɔle bɛ ne yɛle bɛ brienzua ne brasua ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Na ɔtoale so kyɛ: ‘Ɛhe ati yeɛ brienzua kɔyakyi ye baba ne ye maame berɛ, na ɔne ɔye aha abɔnu, maa bɛ munyɔ ne ayɛ anwoɔnaen kõ.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Yeti, bɛtte mmenia nyɔ kõ, mmom anwoɔnaen kõ. Na bɔ Nyameɛ aha abɔnu ne, nnɛmaa sona biala tete nu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Yeɛ bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ye de, nzuati yeɛ Mose hane kyɛ, ebie kɔhora koyira ɔye, ná wama ye krataa bɔ okyire kyɛ wayira ye ne?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ ahone bɔ ɔyɛ se nati yeɛ Mose mane ɛmɔ atee kyɛ ɛmɔyira bɛ yemɔ ne; na ahyɛaseɛ ne, né ɔtte sɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nakoso meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ nná adwamammɔ ti, ná ebie yira ɔye sa gya foforɛ a, wasɛkye agyaa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Yeɛ asuafoɛ ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ sɔ yeɛ edwirɛ ne te wɔ brienzua ne ɔye afia de a, ye de angya po a ɔte pa.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nná ebiala yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔyɛ sɔ ɔ, sana bɛ bɔ bafa bahyɛ bɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ebiemɔ wɔ berɛ a, bɛngɔhora braa gya, ofikyɛ sɔ yeɛ bɛwole bɛ ɔ, ebiemɔ koso ngɔhora braa gya, ofikyɛ mmenia ali bɛ awue,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Basa bɛ”</char></note> yeɛ ebiemɔ koso, anwuro ahennie nati bɛnwa bɛngɔgya braa. Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔyɛ ɛhe ne, ma ɔyɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Na bɛfale ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa bɛbrɛle Yesu kyɛ ɔfa ye sa gua bɛ so, na ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ma bɛ, nakoso asuafoɛ ne sili bɛ atee. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma ngwalaa ne bra me berɛ, nnɛmɔsi bɛ atee! Ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ anwuro Ahennie ne te bɛ deɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ɔfale ye sa guale bɛ so yiele ne, ofili berɛ hɔle.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Afei, ebie wale ye berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, nikye pa beni yeɛ meyɛ a, ngonya daa ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ebisa me pa nwo dwirɛ ne? Nyameɛ ngome twen yeɛ ɔte pa ɔ. Nakoso sɛ ɛpena kyɛ enya ngoa a, kɔ so di mmeraa naso.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yeɛ obisale ye kyɛ: “Enu beni?” Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Nnɛdi awue, nnɛsɛkye agyaa, nnɛwia, nnɛdi adanzewia, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />bu wɔ maame ne wɔ baba, na dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yeɛ abrandeɛ ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mali ɛhe amukoraati so, nzu bieku yeɛ waha ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Sɛ ɛpena kyɛ ɛyɛ ye pɛpɛɛpɛ de a, kɔtɔne wɔ nwo nningyein mukoraati, na fa ma ahiafoɛ, na ekonya agyapadeɛ wɔ anwuro; na bra bali me si.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Abrandeɛ ne tele edwirɛ he ne, ofili berɛ hɔle, na né ye wora abɔ paa, ofikyɛ ne ole agyapadeɛ pee.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔkɔyɛ se kyɛ sikaniɛ kɔhɔ anwuro ahennie nanu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Na mesa meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔkɔyɛ mmerɛ kyɛ afupɔngɔ kowura paneɛ bɔen nu tra kyɛ sikaniɛ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ ahennie nanu ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ tele ɛhe ne, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ye de, nwa yeɛ okonya ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu neane bɛ haa, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɔhale sona ngome a, ahaa ɔngɔyɛ yé, nakoso Nyameɛ de, ɔkora yɛ nikye biala.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Yeɛ Petro bisale ye kyɛ: “Nea, yayakyi nikye biala berɛ yaali wɔ si, nzu deinn yeɛ yekonya ye ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ bayɛ nningyein mukoraati foforɛ, bɔ sona Awa ne te ye anuonyam bia so ne, ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔli me si ne kɔtena ahemvo bia 12 so, na ɛmɔ abu Israel mmusuakue 12 ne atɛn. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na ebiala bɔ me dumaa ti, wayakyi awuro, aliemaa mmrienzua, aliemaa mmrasua, baba mɔ, maame mɔ, mmaa, ne aseɛ berɛ ne, bɛkɔbɔ ye nwo ɛyaa bɛkɔma ye, na okonya daa ngoa koso. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛli moa nanu pee kɔha siɛ, ná bɛ bɔ baha siɛ ne ali moa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Anwuro Ahennie ne te kyɛ efiewura bie bɔ ɔhɔle dwaaso ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, kyɛ ɔkwaapena apaafoɛ maa bɛbayɛ ye bobe boo nu adwuma. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Ɔne bɛhane ye kyɛ, kyẽa ne kɔ awieɛ a, ɔkɔma bɛ dɛnare kõ, yeti bɛne ye hɔle ɛboo nanu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ɔbɔle kɔyɛ ngyerɛmɔ 9:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Dɔn bɔ ɔtɔ so nza”</char></note> ne, ɔhɔle kuro nu, na onwuni kyɛ ebiemɔ gyi-gyi dɔ bɔ bɛnyɛ hwee. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔse bɛɛyɛ me bobe boo nanu adwuma, na ngotua ɛmɔ kerɛ kama.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Yeti, bɛhɔle. Na osa hɔle kuro nu kɔyɛ eyia 12:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Dɔn bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia”</char></note> ne eyia 3:00<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Dɔn bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona”</char></note> ɔɔyɛle sɔ ala. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Na nnɔsoa kɔyɛ 5:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Dɔn bɔ ɔtɔ so buru ne kõ”</char></note> ne, osa hɔle, na onwuni kyɛ ebiemɔ tɛ́ gyi-gyi dɔ bɔ bɛnyɛ hwee. Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: ‘Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ agyina wa ɛnɛ kyẽa namu bɔ ɛmɔ anyɛ adwuma biala ne?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bɛyele ye noa kyɛ: ‘Ebiala ammɔ yɛ paa.’ Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔse bɛɛyɛ me boo nanu adwuma.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, ɛboo wura ne frɛle bɔ ɔnea apaafoɛ naso ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Frɛ apaafoɛ nemɔ na fa b'akatua ma bɛ, hyɛ yebo fi bɔ ɔpɛ yebo naso kodwu bɔ oli moa naso.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Bɛ bɔ bɛwale nnɔsoa 5:00 ne wale ne, ɔmane bɛ nu biala dɛnare kõ. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Yeti, ɔfrɛle bɛ bɔ bɛli moa ne maa bɛwale ne, né b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ bekonya pee bɛkɔtra bɛ bɔ bɛpɛle yebo ne. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ɔfale b'akatua ne mane bɛ ne, bɛbobɔle bɛ bonyi bɛguale efiewura naso <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />kyɛ, ‘Bɛ bɔ bɛwale siɛ ne yɛle adwuma dɔnhwere komapɛ, nakoso yɛbɔ yayɛ adwuma fi ngyerɛmɔ tonn maa eyia ayera yɛ ne, ama yɛ ne bɛ mukoraati akatua kõ.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Nakoso, ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ, ‘Me damvo, mayɛ wɔ bɔne hɔ? Nná dɛnare kõ yeɛ mene wɔ hane ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ, anaa melaka? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />De wɔ sikaa na kɔ, bɔ mafa mama wɔ ne, ebiala yeɛ mefa mema bɔ oli wɔ si ne ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Me bɔbɔ me nikye koso, nnne ye nwo atee kyɛ mefa meyɛ bɔ mekuro anaa? Anaa pa bɔ meyɛ ne yɛ wɔ yea.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yeti, bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne koli moa, na bɔ oli moa ne kɔpɛ yebo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Bɛnate atee so bɛfo bɛkɔ Yerusalem ne, Yesu frɛle asuafoɛ 12 ne hɔle ahameɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Ɛmɔnea, yɛfo yɛkɔ Yerusalem, na bɛkɔfa Sona Awa ne bɛkowura sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ ne sa. Bɛkobu ye kumfɔ, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ná bafa ye bama maen-maen nanufoɛ ne kyɛ bɛgoro ye nwo, bɛgwa ye, na bɛbɔ ye asɛnnua nu; nakoso ɛlɛsa si ne okotingye.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ye si ne, Sebedeo mmaa nemɔ ne bɛ maame wale Yesu berɛ, na bɛbule ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔyɛ nikye bie ma bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔpena ɔ?” Ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Hyɛ me bɔ kyɛ, me mmaa nyɔ he, ɛkɔmaa kõ kɔtena wɔ bɛen na kõ atena wɔ famaa wɔ w'ahennie nu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔse nikye bɔ ɛmɔbisa ne? Kwangoa bɔ mebaano ne, ɛmɔ kɔhora ye no?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yoo, yɛkɔhora.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Kwangoa ne de, ɛmɔ kɔno, nakoso me bɛen so ne me famaa so ne de, ɔtte me deɛ ná mafa mama ɛmɔ, mmom bɛ bɔ me Baba asiesie ama bɛ ne, bɛ yeɛ ɔte bɛ deɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Buru bɔ baha ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛ nye borole aliemaa nyɔ naso paa. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Nakoso Yesu frɛle bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔse kyɛ maen-maen nemɔ nu ne, bɛ bɔ bɛdi tumi ne di mmenia naso bakoma, na atitire ne fa bɛ tumi hyɛ bɛ so. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ nu de, nnɛmɔ maa ɔba ye sɔ; mmom ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔyɛ titire ne, odikyɛ ɔsõ bɛ bɔ baha ne, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na bɔ ɔpena kyɛ odi anyunu ne, odikyɛ ɔyɛ akoaa. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Sɔ ala yeɛ sona Awa ne amma kyɛ bɛsõ ye, mmom ɔwale kyɛ ɔbaasõ, ná ɔfa ye ngoa yɛ agyedeɛ fa de mmeni pee.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Bɛkɔ Yeriko ne, mmeni pee lili ye si. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Né anyesiniwaafoɛ nyɔ bie te atee ne noa, na bɛtele kyɛ Yesu pɛ nu ne, bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Awurade, David awa, nwu yɛ anwunvo!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Nakoso mmenia ne teɛteane bɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ konn. Nakoso bɛteɛteane nu serɛ kyɛ: “Awurade, David Awa, nwu yɛ anwunvo!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yeti Yesu gyinane, na ɔfrɛle bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ meyɛ mema ɛmɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Awurade, yɛpena kyɛ yɛ nye te.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle Yesu aworabɔ, yeti ɔfale ye sa hane bɛ nye ne, na ɛberɛ ala, bɛnwuni nikye, ná bɛlili ye si.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Bɛ́pingye Yerusalem, ná bɛdwuli Bɛtfage bɔ ɔwɔ Olive Bokaa naso ne, Yesu somane ye asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ nnamue bɔ ɛmɔ nye ta ye dɔ nanu, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ bamenda afunum bie ne ɔwa wɔ berɛ. Ɛmɔ sangye bɛ, na ɛmɔfa bɛbra. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Sɛ ebie bisa ɛmɔ ye nwo dwirɛ a, ɛmɔha kyɛ, ‘Awurade hia bɛ.’ Na ɛberɛ ala, ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛ bɛkɔwa.” <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ɛhe sili kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɔ diifoɛ ne hane ne kɔwa nu ɔ, ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ka kyire Zion awa brasua ne kyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Nea, wɔ hene ba wɔ berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">odwo, na ɔte afunum so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">afunum awa bɔ ye maame soa nningyein so.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Yeti, asuafoɛ ne hɔle, na bɛɛyɛle bɔ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bɛfale afunum ne né ɔwa ne bɛwale, na bɛfale bɛ ndadeɛ bɛguale bɛ so maa ɔtena so. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mmeni pee fale bɛ ndadeɛ sɛle atee nanu, na ebiemɔ koso bubuli nyaa guale atee nanu. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Na mmenia bɔ beli ye nyunu ne ye si ne teɛteane nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“David Awa, Hozanna!<note caller="●" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hozanna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">te Hebri dwirɛ bɔ yebo kyire kyɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wɔ, de ye.” Greek nu ne, sɔa yeɛ bɛtworɔ ye ɔ: “ὡσαννά (hōsanná).”</char></note>”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Nhyira yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba Awurade dumaa nu ne!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Wɔ bɔ ɛwɔ anwuro-anwuro dɔ ne, Hozanna!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu wurale Yerusalem kuro nanu ne, kuro nanu yɛle bagya-bagya, na bɛbisale kyɛ: “Nwa ɛne?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mmenia ne yele ye noa kyɛ: “Yesu, diifoɛ bɔ ofi Nazerɛt bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu wurale asɔre awuro berɛ ne, ɔfoane bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne nningyein, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtɔ namukoraati fili berɛ, ɔhane bɛ bɔ bɛsesã sikaa nemɔ tɛbulu ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne mmubure nemɔ bia namukoraati guale ase. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bahworɔ kyɛ, ‘Bɛkɔfrɛ m'awuro ne mbaebɔ awuro,’ nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ afa bayɛ awiefoɛ adwosuo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ɔwɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛ nye asi, ɔne bɛ bɔ babubu wale ye berɛ, na ɔsale b'anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Nakoso sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ ne nwuni anwanwadeɛ bɔ ɔyɛ, ɔne ngwalaa bɔ bɛteɛtea nu wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ kyɛ: “David Awa, Hozanna ne!” Ɔyɛle bɛ ahi. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nnaa ate bɔ ngwalaa nemɔ ka ne?” Yesu hane kyɛ: “Yoo, ɛmɔ kenngale ye le kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Ngwalaa ne bɛ bɔ bɛtua nyɔfone noa ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">bɛ noanu yeɛ ayɛyie fi ba ɔ’?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Na ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ fili kuro nanu hɔle Betania, na kɔngɔen ne, ɛdɔ yeɛ ɔlale ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ngyerɛmɔ bɔ osa ba kuro nanu ne, né ɛhɔen ku ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Onwuni borɔdoma bakaa bie wɔ atee ne noa, na ɔhɔle yebo, nakoso né aleɛ biala nne so, nyaa ngome yeɛ ne ɔwɔ so ɔ. Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bakaa ne kyɛ: “Ɛngosu mmaa kõ.” Na ɛberɛ ala bakaa ne wuli. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ nwuni ɛhe ne, ɔyɛle bɛ nwanwa, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ borɔdoma bakaa ne awu kesaalae ne?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔle gyidie, na ɛmɔ adwene nu nyɛ ɛmɔ nnaa a, nná bɔ nyɛle borɔdoma bakaa ne ngome yeɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ ɔ, mmom sɛ ɛmɔka bɛkyire bokaa he kyɛ, ‘Tu fi wa, na kɔtɔ ɛpo nu’ a, ɔkɔtu. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na bɔ ɛmɔkɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛkɔsrɛ biala ne, sɛ ɛmɔle gyidie a, ɛmɔ sa kɔha ye.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu hɔle asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ okyirekyire ne, sɔfo mbanyi ne maen nanu mbanyi nemɔ wale ye berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Tumi beni yeɛ ɛfa yɛ nningyein hemɔ ne? Na nwa yeɛ ɔmane wɔ sɔ tumi ne?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu koso hane kyɛ: “Mepena kyɛ mebisa ɛmɔ dwirɛ kõ. Sɛ ɛmɔye me noa a, me koso ngɔha nekaa bɔ nyane tumi ne ngohyire ɛmɔ: <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />‘Tumi beni yeɛ ne Yohane fa bɔ asu ne? Ye tumi ne, né ofi anwuro, anaa né ofi sona berɛ?’” Yeɛ bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛsusu ye nwo, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Sɛ yɛka kyɛ ofi anwuro a, okobisa yɛ kyɛ, ‘Ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ anne ye banni ne?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Nakoso sɛ yɛka kyɛ, ‘Ofi sona’ a, yɛnze bɔ mmeni lɔen ne kɔyɛ ɔ, ofikyɛ né bɛnwu ye kyɛ Yohane te diifoɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Yeti bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛnze.” Yeɛ Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzaade me koso, tumi bɔ mefa meyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne, mengɔha mengohyire ɛmɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Ɛmɔdwene ɛhe nwo sɛ? Né biaa bie le mmaa mmrienzua nyɔ, ɔhɔle bɔ oli moa ne berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mma, ɛnɛ, kɔyɛ adwuma wɔ me bobe boo nanu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Mengɔhɔ, nakoso yesi ne, ɔsesane y'adwene, na ɔhɔle.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Biaa ne hɔle bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne berɛ, yeɛ ɔhane edwirɛ komapɛ nala hyirele ye. Yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Daa, ngɔhɔ. Nakoso wangɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ngwalaa nanu beni yeɛ ɔyɛle bɔ Baba ne kuro ɔ? Bɛhane kyɛ, ‘Bɔ oli moa ne.’ Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: ‘Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ, ne bɛ bɔ besi tuutuu ne koli ɛmɔ nyunu moa kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ofikyɛ Yohane wale ɛmɔ berɛ kyɛ ɔbaahyire ɛmɔ tenenee atee ne, ɛmɔ anne ye banni. Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne tuutuufoɛ ne de, bɛlɛle ye bɛlili. Na ɛmɔ nwuni ye sɔ ne po ne, ɛmɔ annu ɛmɔ nwo banne ye banni.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Ɛmɔtie edwirɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mvandoho”</char></note> he koso: Efiewura bie yɛle bobe boo, olɛle ye nwo, otuli nekaa bɔ bɛtwi nzãa wɔ nu, yeɛ osili awaen tendee wɔ nu. Afei ɔfa yakyile ahwɛsofoɛ, na otuli atee. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Osuli ne, ɔsomane ye ngoaa kyɛ bɛhɔ ahwɛsofoɛ ne berɛ, na beele ye kyɛfa deɛ bɛ berɛ ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Nakoso, ahwɛsofoɛ ne hyele ngoaa nemɔ. Bɛbole kõ, bɛhuni kõ, yeɛ bɛsili bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne nyɔboɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Osa somane ngoa bieku, bɛ de, né bɛsone bɛtra bɛ bɔ bɛli moa ne. Nakoso, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛyɛle bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Afei ɔsomane ye bɔbɔ ye kunu ba, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Mma ne de, bɛkɔfɛle ye.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Nakoso ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ nwuni ɔwa ne, bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ, ‘Koliagyaa ne ɛhe, ɛmɔbra ma yɛhu ye, na yɛfa agyapadeɛ ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Yeti bɛhyele ye, na bɛfale ye bɛhɔle ɛboo ne si bɛɛhuni ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Ye de, sɛ ɛboo ne wura ne ba a, nzu yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔyɛ ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɔnate kyɛ bɛtte mmeni pa nati, ɔkɔsɛkye bɛ koraa, na wafa bobe boo ne wama ahwɛsofoɛ foforɛ, bɔ osu a, bɛkɔfa ye kyɛfa bɛkɔma ye ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Ɛmɔ kenngale ye wɔ tworɔnzɛm nanu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Nyɔboɛ bɔ brekyafoɛ ne gyi tole ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">ɛhene yeɛ waayɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ɛhe fi Awurade berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">na ɔyɛ yɛ nwanwa’?<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yeti, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛkole Nyameɛ Ahennie ne bɛkofi ɛmɔ sa nu, ná bafa bama maen bɔ okosu mmaa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Ebiala bɔ okofi nyɔboɛ he aso ne, okobubu pasaa, ná sɛ nyɔboɛ ne tɔ ebie so a, okotĩ ye muhu-muhu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, bɛ nwo dwirɛ yeɛ ɔka ne. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ɔwɔ nu, né bɛpena ye bɛkye ye, nakoso ne bɛsuro mmenia ne, ofikyɛ ne bɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔte diifoɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu sa yɛle mvandoho foforɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Anwuro Ahennie ne te kyɛ ɔhene bie bɔ ɔyɛle paati mane ɔwa brienzua bɔ ɔyɛ ayeforɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Ɔsomane ye ngoaa kyɛ bɛɛfrɛ bɛ bɔ bɛtole bɛ sa bɛfrɛlɛ bɛ ne, nakoso ne bɛnguro kyɛ bɛba. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Osa somane ngoa foforɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: ‘Ka kyerɛ bɛ bɔ yɛfrɛle bɛ ne kyɛ: “Masisie m'aleɛ ne mayie, mahu me nandwie nyii mɔ ne ngaka bɔ balɔ, na masiesie nikye biala mayie.”’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Nakoso, bandɛ bɛ so, na ebiala hɔle ye atee, kõ hɔle ye fiɛso, yeɛ kõ koso hɔle ye dwaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Bɛ bɔ baha ne hyele ngoaa ne, bɛguale bɛ nyunu ase, na bɛhuni bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Ɔhene ne fɛle yaa paa, na ɔsomane ye sogyafoɛ nemɔ maa bɛɛhuni sɔ awudifoɛ ne, na bɛyerale bɛ kuro ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye ngoaa ne kyɛ, ‘Ayeforɔ ne adwu so, nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛfrɛle bɛ ne, bɛmvata. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Yeti, ɛmɔhɔ atee nemɔ aso, na ebiala bɔ ɛmɔ konwu ye ne, ɛmɔfrɛ ye ma ɔbra ayeforɔ ne abo.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Yeti, ngoaa ne hɔle atee nemɔ aso, na bɛfrɛle ebiala bɔ bɛnwuni ye, mmeni pa ne mmeni tɛɛ. Na sua bɔ bɛyɛ ayeforɔ wɔ nu nanu yili tɛkyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Nakoso ɔhene ne wale kyɛ ɔbaanea mmenia bɔ bawa ne, onwuni biaa bie, ye de, né owurra ayeforɔ atadeɛ ne bie. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Obisale ye kyɛ: ‘Me damvo, ewurra ayeforɔ atadeɛ ne bie, yeti ɛyɛle sɛɛ yeɛ ɛwale wa ɔ?’ Ná wangora dwudwo. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Yeɛ ɔhene ne ha hyirele ye ngoaa nemɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔkyekye ye gya ne ye sa, na ɛmɔgyi ye bɛto awosii nanu wɔ aluo dɔ. Ɛberɛ yeɛ okosu ná wanwose ye gye ɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ofikyɛ bafrɛ mmeni pee, nakoso kaa bie baye bɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Farisifoɛ nemɔ hɔle, ná bɛɛpenane atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔmaa ɔkɔha edwirɛ bie, ne banya ye. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Yeti, bɛsomane b'asuafoɛ ne, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛta Herode si ne maa bɛɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yɛse kyɛ ɛka nahorɛ, na bɔ ɛka fa Nyameɛ nwo ne koso te nahorɛ, ɛmbena anuonyam wɔ sona nyunu, yeɛ ɛnnea ebiala nyunu koso. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Yeti, w'adwene yɛ wɔ sɛ: Mmeraa ma atee kyɛ yetua toɔ yɛma Kaesare, anaa ɔmma ate?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Nakoso né Yesu anwu adwemmɔne bɔ otira bɛ ne, yeti ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nyaatwomfoɛ, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ baasɔ me bɛnea ne? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Ma nnea sikaa bɔ ɛmɔfa betua toɔ ne.” Yeti, bɛmane ye dɛnare kõ. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa foto ne ye sa noa yeɛ ɔwɔ so ne?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Yeɛ bɛhane kyɛ: “Kaesare.” Yeti Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ye de, ɛmɔtua Kaesare deɛ bɛma Kaesare, na ɛmɔtua Nyameɛ deɛ bɛma Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛ nwo dwirili bɛ pa-pa, na bɛfili berɛ bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Sɔ ɛlɛho nala, Sadukifoɛ bɔ bɛnwa bɛngɔtingye awufo ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, Mose hane kyɛ: ‘Sɛ brienzua bie anwo mmaa na owu a, odikyɛ oliema brienzua gya ɔye ne, na ɔwo mmaa ma oliema ne.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ye de, né yɛne aliemaa mmrienzua nzoo bie wɔ wa. Bɔ oli moa ne gyale braa, ɔne ye annwo yeɛ owuli ɔ. Yeti ɔyakyile ɔye ne mane oliema bɔ oli berɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔtole bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne, maa oodwuli bɔ ɔtɔ so nzoo naso ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Afei, brasua ne wuli. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Yeti sɛ bɛtingye bɛ a, mmenia nzoo ne, nwa yeɛ okogya braa ne ɔ? Ofikyɛ bɛ nu biala gyale ye.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔnde Tworɔnzɛm nabo, na ɛmɔnze Nyameɛ tumi nati, ɛmɔdi mvomsoɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ofikyɛ bɛtingye awufo a, mmrienzua ngogya, na bɛngɔfa mmrasua bɛngɔma agyaa. Mmom bɛkɔyɛ kyɛ abɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Na ɔfa awufo bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ nanwo ne, ɛmɔ kenngale bɔ Nyameɛ ha hyirele ɛmɔ ne? Ɔhane kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nde Abraham Nyameɛ, Isaac Nyameɛ, ne Yakob Nyameɛ.’ Ɔtte Awufo Nyameɛ, mmom ateasefoɛ Nyameɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Mmenia ne tele ɛhe ne, ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne yɛle bɛ nwanwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Farisifoɛ nemɔ tele kyɛ wamaa Sadukifoɛ nemɔ aha bɛ noa ato nu ne, bɛboale bɛ nwo noa. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Na bɛ nu kõ bɔ ɔse mmeraa nanu paa bisale ye dwirɛ kyɛ ɔfa sɔ ye nea. Obisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, mmeraa ne, enu beni yeɛ ɔte piri ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “‘Fa w'ahone mukoraati, wɔ kra mukoraati, ne w'adwene mukoraati dɔ Awurade, wɔ Nyameɛ.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Sɔ ahyɛdeɛ he yeɛ oli moa ɔ, na ye yeɛ ye nwo hia paa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne, ɔte kyɛ ɛhene ala, yeɛ ole kyɛ: ‘Dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mmeraa ne né adiifoɛ namukoraati gyi ahyɛdeɛ nyɔ he aso.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Farisifoɛ ne boale bɛ noa ne, Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Ɛmɔnwu Kristo ne sɛ? Nwa awa ɛne?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “David.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yeɛ Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ye de nzuati yeɛ honhom ne maa David frɛle ye me wura ɔ? Ofikyɛ ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Awurade ha hyirele me wura kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">“Tena me sa famaa so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">kodwu kyɛ ngɔfa w'atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">ngogua wɔ gya bo.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Yeti, sɛ David frɛ ye me wura de a, ɔwale ye sɛ yeɛ ɔte ɔwa ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Ebiala angora anye ye noa. Na ofi sɔ kyẽa ne, ebiala ammɔ ye nwo mmusue ammisa ye dwirɛ biala kõ.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele mmenia ne né ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ nwa bɛte Mose bia so. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Yeti bɔ bɛka bɛkyire ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔli so, na ɛmɔyɛ, nakoso bɔ bɛyɛ ne de, nnɛmɔyɛ bie, ofikyɛ bɔ bɛka ne, bɛmva bɛnyɛ adwuma. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bakyekye nningyein nnunɛ-nnunɛ bato mmenia kɔme anwo, nakoso bɛ de, bɛnguro kyɛ bɛfa bɛ sa ba po bɛka ye. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bɔ bɛyɛ namukoraati, bɛyɛ ye wɔ mmenia nyunu. Bayɛ tworɔnzɛm nwomaa bɔ bɛfa bɛbɔ bɛ nwo waen ne mbiri-mbiri, yeɛ bayɛ bɛ ndadeɛ noa wowaa. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Sɛ bɛkɔ paati bo a, nekaa bɔ mbanyi tena yeɛ bɛkuro ɔ, na sɛ bɛkɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu a, ɛyɛ a né bɛpena anyunu bia. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Bɛkuro dwaaso ngyeaa, na bɛpena kyɛ mmenia frɛ bɛ ‘Rabi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Nakoso, nnɛmɔ maa ebiala frɛ ɛmɔ ‘Rabi,’ ofikyɛ sona-horɛ yeɛ ɔte ɛmɔ kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ɔ, ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔte aliemaa. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Na nnɛmɔ frɛ ebiala kyɛ ɛmɔ baba wɔ aseɛ he aso, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ Baba te komapɛ, yeɛ ɔwɔ anwuro ne. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Afei koso, nnɛmɔ maa bɛfrɛ ɛmɔ kannifoɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ kannifoɛ te komapɛ, yeɛ ole Kristo. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mmom bɔ ɔte piri wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, odikyɛ ɔsõ bɛ bɔ baha ne. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔma ye nwo so ne, bɛkɔbrɛ ye ase, na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔbrɛ ye nwo ase ne, bɛkɔma ye so.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ato anwuro Ahennie né anoa nanu. Ɛmɔ ahɔ a, ɛmɔ ngɔ nu, na bɛ bɔ bɛkɔ nu ne koso, ɛmɔsi bɛ atee.”<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />
    <note caller="*" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char>
      <char style="bdit">Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔdɛ akunafoɛ awuro, na ɛmɔhyɛda bɛbɔ mbaeɛ ndendee wɔ mmenia nu; yeti ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ konya atemmuo bɔ ye noa yɛ hye paa ne.</char> Nakoso, sɛ ɛnea asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔnne nu.</note> — <verse eid="MAT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ! Nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔpɛ atee bɛfa ɛpo ne aseɛ so bɛkɔsakra sona-horɛ, na sɛ ɔsakra a, ɛmɔma ɔbafata ma <char style="w">Gehenna</char>, ofikyɛ ɛmɔma ye bɔne ne bayɛ kyɛ ɛmɔ deɛ ne bɔ bafa babɔ ye nwo nyɔ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Anyesiniwaafoɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kyire atee, ɛmɔ yaakɔ! Ɛmɔka kyɛ: ‘Sɛ ebie ka asɔre awuro ne ndaen a, ɔtte hwee, nakoso sɛ ɔka sikaa kɔkorɛ bɔ ɔwɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne ndaen de a, odikyɛ odi so.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Anyesiniwaafoɛ ngwaseafoɛ! Beni yeɛ ɔte piri ɔ, sikaa kɔkorɛ ne, anaa asɔre awuro ne bɔ wamaa sikaa kɔkorɛ nanwo ate ne? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Ɛmɔsa bɛka kyɛ, ‘Sɛ ebie ka afɔleɛ bokyea ne ndaen a, ɔtte hwee, nakoso sɛ ɔka akyɛdeɛ bɔ ogua bokyea naso ne ndaen de a, odikyɛ odi so.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Anyesiniwaafoɛ! Beni yeɛ ɔte piri ɔ, akyɛdeɛ ne, anaa afɔleɛ bokyea ne bɔ ɔmaa akyɛdeɛ nanwo te ne? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔka afɔleɛ bokyea ne ndaen ne, waha nikye biala bɔ ɔwɔ so ne ndaen. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔka asɔre awuro ne ndaen, waha ɔne Bɔ ɔte nu namukoraati ndaen. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Na bɔ ɔka anwuro ndaen ne, waha Nyameɛ bia<note caller="٭" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ, “Ɔhene bia” anaa “Ahennie bia.”</char></note> ne Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte so namukoraati ndaen.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, nyaatwomfoɛ! Ɛmɔtua ɛmanyire, ɛsaa, ne ngete-ngete nwo taet, nakoso nningyein bɔ ye nwo hia wɔ mmeraa nanu te kyɛ atɛn tenenee, anwunvoin, ne nahorɛ ne de, ɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nye bɛgua so. Sɛ ɛmɔdɛ taet ne a, ongyire kyɛ ɛmɔbu ɛmɔ nye bɛgua bɔ ohia paa naso. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Anyesiniwaafoɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kyire atee, Ɛmɔ songyi anonneɛ so bɛye ndondom, nakoso, ɛmɔme afupɔngɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ, nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔnwunzi kwangoa ne kyɛnzee nwo, nakoso ye kunu de, apoo ne akɔnnɔ-bɔne ayi ye tɛkyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Farisifoɛ anyesiniwaafoɛ, ɛmɔli moa bɛnwunzi kwangoa ne kyɛnzee ne kunu, na ye nwo ne koso kofi.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ! Nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔte kyɛ asieleɛ bɔ baha ye nwo fufue hyɛnn, ná ye nwo yɛ nyemene, nakoso ye kunu de, fuin mmowie, ne nningyein fiɛ ngome. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwo teneneefoɛ wɔ mmenia nyunu, nakoso ɛmɔte nyaatwom ne mmeratofoɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Atwerɛfoɛ ne Farisifoɛ, ɛmɔ yaakɔ! Nyaatwomfoɛ! Ofikyɛ ɛmɔto adiifoɛ nemɔ asieleɛ, na ɛmɔsiesie ateneneefoɛ nemɔ asieleɛ so kama, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />na ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Sɛ ne yɛwɔ yɛ baba mɔ aberɛ so a, ahaa yɛngɔ boka bɛ maa bɛngɔhwie adiifoɛ nemɔ mogya bɛngɔgua.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Yeti, ɛmɔdi adanzeɛ betia ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ ɛmɔ baba mɔ yeɛ bɛhuni adiifoɛ nemɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ye de, bɔ ɛmɔ baba mɔ hyɛle yebo ne, ɛmɔyie. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Ɛwoo, ɛkyerebene mmaa, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ɛmɔ ahora banwati <char style="w">Gehenna</char> atemmuo? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ɛhe ati, mesoma adiifoɛ, anyanzafoɛ, ne akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ. Ɛmɔ kohu bɛ nu biemɔ, na ɛmɔ asinze bɛ wɔ bakaa so, na ɛmɔ kogwa ebiemɔ wɔ sua bɔ ɛmɔ yia nu nanu, na ɛmɔ atane bɛ nye bafi kuro kõ anu bahɔ foforɛ nu. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Yeti, ateneneefoɛ bɔ bahwie bɛ mogya bagua aseɛ he aso ne, ɔkɔwa ɛmɔ so, ofi teneneeniɛ Habel mogya so, ɔbaadwu Barakia awa Zakaria, bɔ ɛmɔ hunu ye wɔ nekaa krongron ne afɔleɛ bokyea ne afia ne mogya so. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛhe amukoraati kɔwa sɔ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> naso.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“O Yerusalem, Yerusalem, wɔ bɔ ɛku adiifoɛ na ɛsi bɛ bɔ bɛsomane bɛ wɔ berɛ ne nyɔboɛ, nea mmerɛ-tende bɔ ne mepena kyɛ meboɔboa wɔ mmaa mɔ noa, kyɛbɔ akɔ taen boɔboa ye mmaa noa wɔ ye ndaa bo ne, nakoso ambene. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Nea, bayakyi w'awuro bama wɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, ɛmɔ ngonwu me kõ kodwu kyɛ ɛmɔkɔha kyɛ, ‘Nhyira yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba Awurade dumaa nu’ ne.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu fí asɔre awuro berɛ kɔ ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ kyɛ bɛbaahyire ye sua ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnaa ɛmɔ anwu ɛhe mukoraati? Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛngɔyakyi nyɔboɛ kõ wɔ nyɔboɛ so; bɛkɔdwiri ye mukoraati bɛkogua ase.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Na ɔte Olive Bokaa naso ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ kodɛɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ka kyire yɛ, mmerɛ beni yeɛ ɛhemɔ kosi ɔ, na nzu yeɛ ɔkɔyɛ wɔ walɛ ne, ɔne wiase ne awieɛ nanwo nzɛngyerɛneɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea yé, na ebiala anlaka-laka ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ofikyɛ mmeni pee kɔfa me dumaa kɔwa kɔɔha kyɛ, ‘Me yeɛ nne Kristo ne,’ na bɛkɔlaka-laka mmeni pee. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ɛmɔ kɔte koɛ ne koɛ nwo amaneɛbɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Dwirɛ.”</char></note> nakoso, nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ. Odikyɛ nningyein hemɔ sisi, nakoso né awieɛ ne nya walle. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Na maen kɔdwɔso kotia maen, ná ahennie adwɔso atia ahennie, na ɛhɔen ne aseɛ wosolɛ kosi nekaa ahoroɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ɛhe mukoraati te aworɛ nu yealɛ né ahyɛaseɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Afei, mmenia kɔteetee ɛmɔ, ná bahu ɛmɔ, na me dumaa ti, maen-maen namukoraati kɔtane ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ɛhe kɔto mmeni pee sintidua maa bɛkɔye bɛ nwo bɛkɔma, na batane-tane bɛ nwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Na ngondombo adiifoɛ pee kɔwa, na bɛkɔlaka-laka mmeni pee. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Amumuyɛɛ bɔ ɔkɔsone nati, ɔdɔ bɔ mmeni pee le ye ne noa kodwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Nakoso bɔ okogyina nu koodwu awieɛ ne, ye yeɛ bɛkole ye ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Na bɛkɔha ahennie nanwo nzɛmba he wɔ wiase mukoraati, maa ɔkɔyɛ adanzeɛ kɔma maen-maen namukoraati, kora né awieɛ ne awa.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Yeti, sɛ ɛmɔnwu akyiwadeɛ bɔ ɔbɔ maen, bɔ diifoɛ Daniel hane ye nwo dwirɛ ne kyɛ ogyi nekaa krongron berɛ a (odikyɛ bɔ ɔkenga ne te ye bo), <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />ɛmɔma bɛ bɔ bɛte Yudea ne nwati hɔ mmokaa so. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Bɔ ɔte sua ti afia ne, nnɛmaa odwu ba ase kyɛ ɔbaafa nikye biala fi ye awuro, <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />na bɔ wahɔ fiɛso ne, nnɛmaa ɔba awuro kyɛ ɔbaafa ye atadeɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Mmrasua bɔ bɛnwonzɛ, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛma nyɔfone ne de, bɛ yaakɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ, ná kyẽa bɔ ɛmɔkɔfa bɛkɔnwati ne anzi ayirɛ mmerɛ, anaa Homeda. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ofikyɛ ahohiehia kandinga bie kɔwa, sɔ ahohiehia ne, ofi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle wiase ne, ebie walle lle, na yesi ne, ebie nngɔwa kõ. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Nahorɛ, sɛ bambɛ sɔ ngyẽa naso a, sona-horɛ po nngonya ngoa, nakoso bɛ bɔ baye bɛ nati, bɛkɔpɛ sɔ ngyẽa naso. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, sɛ ebie ka kyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Nea, Kristo wɔ wa’ anaa ‘Ɔwɔ dɔ’ a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ bɛdi. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ofikyɛ ngondombo Kristo ne ngondombo adiifoɛ pee kɔwa, na bɛkɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee bɛkɔfa bɛkɔlaka-laka mmenia, na sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, balaka-laka bɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne po. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Ɛmɔnea, mali moa maha mahyire ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Yeti, sɛ mmenia ka kyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Nea, ɔwɔ ɛserɛ so’ a, nnɛmɔ kɔ, na sɛ bɛka kyɛ ‘Ɔwɔ sua nu’ a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ bɛdi. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ná kyɛbɔ agralaa te yerɛm fi afiteleɛ, na ɔta kodwu atɔleɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Sona Awa ne walɛ ne koso kɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Na nekaa bɔ fuin wɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ mbɛtɛ nemɔ boa bɛ noa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Ahohiehia ne si pɛɛ ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Eyia kɔkakyi awosii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">ɛsraen nngɔta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">nzramaa kɔtete kofi anwuro kogua ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">na bɛkɔwoso anwuro tumi.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Afei, bɛkonwu Sona Awa ne nwo nzɛngyerɛneɛ wɔ anwuro, na aseɛ so mmusuakue mukoraati kɔbɔ awuye. Na bɛkonwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne nate munungum<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Anwuro munungum”</char></note> nu ɔba, bɔ ole tumi ne anuonyam kandinga. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Na ɔkɔsoma ye abɔfo maa bɛkɔhu awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> bɔ yenoa yɛ se paa bɛkoli ye nyunu, na bɛkɔboɔboa bɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne noa bɛkofi mvrama nná nanu, fi anwuro noa kodwu ye noa.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Afei, ɛmɔsua nikye bie bɛfi borɔdoma bakaa ne berɛ: Sɛ onya fa nyaa a, ɛmɔse kyɛ, ɔngɔhyɛ ne ahuhuro awa. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔnwu ɛhemɔ a, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ wadwu anoa ne noa pɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ne nngɔpɛ nu, sana edwirɛ he amukoraati awa nu kora. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Anwuro ne aseɛ kɔpɛ nu, nakoso me dwirɛ ne de, ɔngɔpɛ nu lle.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Kyẽa ne né dɔnhwere ne de, ebiala nze, abɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne Baa ne po nze, Baba ne ngome yeɛ ɔse ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Na kyɛbɔ Nowa ngyẽa ne yɛle ne, sɔ ala yeɛ sona Awa ne walɛ ne koso kɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, kora bɔ nzuyiri ne ba ne, bɛdidili, bɛnone, mmrienzua gyale, na bɛfale mmrasua bɛmane agyaa tonn oodwuli kyɛ Nowa wurale alaka nanu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Ná bannwu ye nwo hwee oodwuli kyɛ nzue ne yi fale bɛ mukoraati hɔle ɔ. Sɔ ala yeɛ sona awa ne walɛ ne koso kɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Mmenia nyɔ kɔhɔ fiɛso, bɛkɔfa kõ, na bayakyi kõ. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Mmrasua nyɔ kotĩ nikye wɔ nyɔboɛ kõ so, bɛkɔfa kõ, na bayakyi kõ. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnze kyẽa bɔ ɛmɔ Wura ne kɔwa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Nakoso ɛmɔkaye kyɛ: Sɛ efiewura ne se mmerɛ bɔ awieniɛ ne kɔwa a, ahaa okosi pɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a awieniɛ ne ngonya atee ngɔwa ye awuro berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ye sɔ nati, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔsiesie ɛmɔ nwo besie, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nye nne so nanu yeɛ sona Awa ne kɔwa ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Nwa po yeɛ ole akoaa bɔ odi nahorɛ na ɔse nworɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔte badwemma.”</char></note> ne? Ye yeɛ ye wura aye ye kyɛ ɔma ye asomvoɛ aleɛ wɔ mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Anigye yeɛ ole akoaa bɔ ye wura kɔwa kɔɔto ye kyɛ ogu so ɔyɛ sɔ ne. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔkɔmaa ɔkɔnea bɔ ole ye namukoraati so. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Nakoso sɛ akoaa bɔ ɔttemaye ne ka ye wɔ ye ahone nu kyɛ, ‘Me wura mia, onya walle,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />na ɔhyɛ yebo bo ye mmango ngoaa nemɔ, na ɔne akɔwenzafoɛ didi na bɛno a, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />ye de, kyẽa bɔ ye nye nne ye nwo so, ɔne dɔnhwere bɔ ɔnnea atee nanu yeɛ ye wura ne koofu ye nu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Ɔkɔhwe ye so paa,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ɔkɔte ye nu nyɔ”</char></note> na wafa ye waboka nyaatwomfoɛ nemɔ so. Ɛberɛ yeɛ okosu kɔnwose ye gye ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Afei, anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ mmabunu buru bie bɔ bɛfale bɛ nganea kyɛ bɛkwaayia brienzua bɔ ɔyɛ ayeforɔ ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Né bɛ nu nnu te ngwasea, yeɛ ne nnu koso se nworɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ngwaseafoɛ nemɔ fale bɛ nganea ne, bamva kerezin<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ngoo”</char></note> bammoka so. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Nakoso, anyanzafoɛ nemɔ fale kerezin guale towaa nu bokale bɛ nganea naso. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Brienzua bɔ ɔbaayɛ ayeforɔ ne hyɛle, yeti bɛ mukoraati né bɛ nye kõ, na bɛlale. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Na kɔngɔen tumm ne, ebie teane nu kyɛ: ‘Brienzua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Brienzua bɔ ɔyɛ ayeforɔ”</char></note> ne ba oo! Ɛmɔhɔ beeyia ye.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Yeti, mmabunu namukoraati dwɔsole, na bɛsosɔle bɛ nganea ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Yeɛ ngwaseafoɛ ne ha hyirele anyanzafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔma yɛ ɛmɔ kerezin ne bie; na yɛ nganea ne baanua.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Anyanzafoɛ ne koso hane kyɛ, ‘Daabi, ɔngɔso yɛ po, né wasõ ɛmɔ. Ɛmɔhɔ bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne ye ne berɛ, na ɛmɔɔtɔ bie.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Bɛnate atee so bɛkɔ ne, brienzua bɔ ɔyɛ ayeforɔ ne wale. Mmabunu bɔ baboaboa bɛ nwo ne, bɛne ye hɔle ayeforɔ nabo, na bɛtole anoa nanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ye si ne, mmabunu ngaa nemɔ wale, na bɛhane kyɛ, ‘Yɛ wura, yɛ wura, bukye yɛ!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, ‘Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ, menze ɛmɔ.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnze kyẽa ne, anaa dɔnhwere ne.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Afei koso, anwuro ahennie ne te kyɛ biaa bie bɔ ɔbaatu atee, na ɔfrɛle ye ngoaa fale ye nningyein wurale bɛ sa. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Ɔmane kõ talɛnde<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Talɛnde kõ nyɔboɛ kɔyɛ dɛnare 6,000, wɔ Roman sikaa nu.</char></note> nnu, ɔmane foforɛ talɛnde nyɔ, yeɛ ɔmane kõ ne koso talɛnde kõ, kyɛbɔ bɛ nu biala anwoserɛ te ɔ. Na otule ye atee ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ɛberɛ ala, bɔ onyane nnu ne hyɛle yebo fa yɛle adwuma, na onyane nnu bokale so. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Bɔ onya nyɔ ne koso nyane nyɔ bokale so. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Nakoso bɔ onyane kõ ne de, otutule ase, yeɛ ɔfale ye wura ne sikaa ne feale berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Afoɛ bie si ne, ngoaa nemɔ wura ne wale kyɛ ɔne bɛ baabu ngondaa. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yeti, akoaa bɔ onyane talɛnde nnu ne ba ne, ɔfale nnu bokale so wale, na ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Me wura, talɛnde nnu yeɛ ɛfa mane me ɔ, nea, manya nnu maboka so.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Ye wura ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mo, akoaa pa bɔ odi nahorɛ! Ali nningyein kaa he anu nahorɛ. Ngɔfa pee ngowura wɔ sa. Nya wɔ wura anigye ne bie.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Na akoaa bɔ onyane nyɔ ne koso wale, na ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Me wura, talɛnde nyɔ yeɛ ɛfa mane me ɔ, manya nyɔ maboka so.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Ye wura ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Mo, akoaa pa bɔ odi nahorɛ! Ali nningyein kaa he anu nahorɛ. Ngɔfa pee ngowura wɔ sa. Nya wɔ wura anigye ne bie.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Afei, akoaa bɔ onyane talɛnde kõ ne wale, na ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Me wura, mese kyɛ wɔ dwirɛ yɛ se; nekaa bɔ elluale hwee ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛpɛ ɔ, ná nekaa bɔ ɛhulli hwee ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛsesa ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Yeti né mesuro, na mvale wɔ sikaa ne ngɔnveale ase. Ye ɛhe, de wɔ nikye.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Yeɛ ye wura ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Wɔ akoaa he, wɔ ti anu yɛ se, na ɛte foen! Nnaa ɛse kyɛ bɔ nnuale ne yeɛ mepɛ ɔ, na bɔ nnhuli ne yeɛ mesesa ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Nzuati yeɛ amva me sikaa ne ando bank, na meba a, mannya ye nwo nzihoɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Ɛmɔle talɛnde kõ ne bɛfi ye sa nu, na ɛmɔfa bɛma bɔ ole talɛnde buru ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ole bie ne, bɛkɔfa pee bɛkɔboka ye so, na okonya ye maa okobu so. Na bɔ olle bie ne de, bɔ ole ye ne po, bɛkole bɛkofi ye sa nu. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ɛmɔfinde sɔ akoaa bɔ mvasoɛ nne ye so ne bɛto awosii nanu wɔ aluo dɔ. Ɛberɛ yeɛ okosu kɔnwose ye gye ɔ.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Sɛ sona Awa ne ba ye anuonyam nu, bɔ ye abɔfo mukoraati boka ye so ne, ɔkɔtena ye anuonyam bia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ɔhene bia”</char></note> so. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ná ɔkɔboaboa maen-maen namukoraati noa wɔ ye nyunu, na ɔkɔyeye bɛ nu, kyɛbɔ bɛ bɔ bɛnea mmoan ne yeye mmoan ne mmɔngye nu ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ɔkɔfa mmoan ne kosie ye sa famaa so, na wafa mmɔngye ne wasie ye sa bɛen so. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Na Ɔhene ne kɔha kohyire bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ ye famaa so ne kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔbra, ɛmɔ bɔ me Baba ayira ɛmɔ, ɛmɔɔfa Ahennie bɔ basiesie bama ɛmɔ fi wiase ahyɛaseɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ofikyɛ ɛhɔen huni me ne, ɛmɔ mane me aleɛ, nzuhɔen huni me ne, ɛmɔ mane me nzue, nyɛle ɛwɔfoɛ ne, ɛmɔlɛle me kama, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />mmerɛ bɔ me nwo la so ne, ɛmɔ wurale me atadeɛ, mvokyɛle ne, ɛmɔ wale bɛɛneane me, ná nna prizin ne, ɛmɔ wale bɛɛsrale me.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Yeɛ ateneneefoɛ nemɔ kobisa ye kyɛ, ‘Awurade, mmerɛ beni yeɛ yɛnwuni kyɛ ne ɛhɔen ku wɔ, bɔ yɛmane wɔ aleɛ maa ɛlili, anaa nzuhɔen ku wɔ, bɔ yɛmane wɔ nzue maa ɛnone ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Mmerɛ beni yeɛ yɛnwuni kyɛ ɛte wɔfoɛ bɔ yɛfale wɔ yɛhɔle awuro, anaa wɔ nwo la so bɔ yɛwurale wɔ atadeɛ ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Na mmerɛ beni yeɛ né afokyɛ anaa ɛla prizin bɔ yɛɛneane wɔ ɔ?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Na Ɔhene ne kɔha kohyire bɛ kyɛ, ‘Nahorɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ bɛmane nniema mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ ne, ɛmɔyɛ bɛmane me.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Na ɔkɔha kohyire bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ ye bɛen so ne kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔ bɔ badome ɛmɔ, ɛmɔfi me so bɛhɔ see bɔ ɔsɔ daa, bɔ basiesie bama Abɔnzam ne ye abɔfo nanu. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ofikyɛ ɛhɔen huni me ne, ɛmɔ amma me aleɛ, nzuhɔen huni me, na ɛmɔ amma me nzue ma manno. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nyɛle ɛwɔfoɛ ne, ɛmɔ anne me, me nwo la so ne, ɛmɔ anwura me atadeɛ, mvokyɛle na ngɔ nnale prizin, nakoso ɛmɔ amma anzra me.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Na bɛ koso, bɛkobisa ye kyɛ, ‘Awurade, mmerɛ beni yeɛ yɛnwuni kyɛ ɛhɔen ku wɔ, nzuhɔen ku wɔ, ayɛ wɔfoɛ, wɔ nwo la so, afokyɛ, anaa ɛla prizin bɔ yammoka wɔ ɔ?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Yeɛ Ɔhene ne kɔha kohyire bɛ kyɛ, ‘Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ annyɛ bamma nniema mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ po ne, ɛmɔ anyɛ bamma me.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Yeti, bɛkɔsɛkye ɛhemɔ koraa, na ateneneefoɛ ne de, bɛkɔhɔ daa ngoa nu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu hane edwirɛ he amukoraati yiele ne, ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔse ne, waha ɛlɛnyɔ né bɛdi Pɛnu ne, na bɛkɔye sona awa ne bɛkɔma maa bɛkɔbɔ ye asɛnnua nu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né sɔfo mbanyi ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne aboa bɛ nwo noa wɔ sɔfo panyi bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Kaiafa né awuro,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Aluo berɛ”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />na bɛbɔle porɛ kyɛ bɛkɔhye Yesu kodɛɛ bɛkɔhu ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Nakoso bɛhane kyɛ: “Yɛngɔyɛ ye wɔ afahyɛ nabo, wanyɛ sɔ a, mmenia ne kɔyɛ basabasa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu wɔ kwataniɛ Simon awuro wɔ Betania ne, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />maame bie wale ye nwo berɛ, né otira alabasta towaa bɔ ngoo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “lafenta” — Ɔte nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛgua bɛ nwo maa bɛ nwo bo fona ɔ.</char></note> fona-fona bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se wɔ nu ɔ. Yesu didi ne, ohwiele ngoo ne guale ye ti so. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ nwuni ye sɔ ne, né ɔyɛ bɛ ahi, yeti bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛhe bɔ ɛsɛkye ye ne, yebo yeɛ ole sɛɛ? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Ɛkɔhora kɔtɔne ye konya sikaa pee, na afa ama ahiafoɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu nwuni ye sɔ ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔha maame ne? Nikye pa yeɛ wayɛ wama me ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Ahiafoɛ de, daa biala bɛwɔ ɛmɔ nwo wa, nakoso me de, ɛmɔngonya me daa. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ɔfale sɔ ngoo fona-fona he guale me nwo ne, ne osiesie me nipadua ne ma kyẽa bɔ bɛkosie me ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nekaa biala bɔ bɛkɔha nzɛmba he wɔ wiase mukoraati ne, bɔ maame he ayɛ ne, bɛkɔha bɛkɔkaye ye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Afei, buru-ne-nyɔ nanu kõ bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yuda Iskariot hɔle sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ berɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ meye ye mema ɛmɔ a, nzu yeɛ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkɔma me ɔ?” Na bɛne ye hane kyɛ bɛkɔma ye dwetɛ aburasa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Yeti ofi sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔpena atee bɔ ɔkɔfa so kɔye Yesu kɔma ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Kyẽa bɔ oli moa bɔ bɛdi Paanoo bɔ Yiste nne nu ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wale Yesu berɛ na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ yɛkosiesie maa ɛdi Pɛnu ne?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ kuro nanu, Asomasi berɛ, na ɛmɔha behyire ye kyɛ, ‘Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne nwa: “Me mmerɛ ne apingye; na w'awuro wa yeɛ mene m'asuafoɛ ne koli Pɛnu ne ɔ” ’” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Yeti, asuafoɛ nemɔ yɛle bɔ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ ne pɛpɛɛpɛ, bɛsiesiele bɛ nwo bɛmane Pɛnu ne.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, Yesu ne buru-ne-nyɔ ne tenane tɛbulu nwo. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Bɛguso bɛdidi ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ nu kõ kɔye me kɔma.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Edwirɛ ne maa bɛ wora bɔle, yeti, bɛhyɛle yebo bɛbisale ye ngoko-ngoko kyɛ: “Awurade, me anaa?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ɔne me to asaa didi wɔ kyɛnzee kõ anu ne, ye yeɛ ɔkɔye me kɔma ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Nahorɛ, sona Awa ne kɔ, kyɛbɔ bahworɔ bafa ye nwo ne, nakoso bɔ ɔkɔye ye kɔma ne, ye yaakɔ! Sɛ banwo sɔ sona ne po a, ahaa ɔte pa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yeɛ Yuda bɔ ɔkɔye ye kɔma ne hane kyɛ: “Rabi, me anaa?” Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ, “Wɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ aha ne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Bɛguso bɛdidi ne, Yesu fale paanoo, na oyirale so yiele ne, obubule nu, yeɛ ɔfa mane asuafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle bɛli. Ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me nwonaen.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Yeɛ ɔfale kwangoa ne, na ɔlale ase, yeɛ ɔfa mane bɛ hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔ no. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me ‘mogya bɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ apam’ ne, bɔ mmeni pee bɔne-fakyɛ ti, bɛkɔhwie bɛkogua ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Na meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ: Ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, mengɔno bobe nzãa he kõ, kodwu kyɛ mene ɛmɔ kɔno ye bieku wɔ me Baba Ahennie nu ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Afei, bɛtole ayɛyie dwein bɛyiele ne, bɛfili berɛ bɛhɔle Olive Bokaa naso. <verse eid="MAT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, “Bɔ ɔkɔto me ɛnɛ nnɔsoa ne, ɔkɔto ɛmɔ mukoraati sintidua, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Ngopira bɔ ɔnea mmoan ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">na mmoan namukoraati kɔbɔ kɔsande.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Nakoso bɛtingye me a, ngoli ɛmɔ nyunu mmoa ngɔhɔ Galilea.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Nakoso, Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɔwɔ nu, bɔ okosi ne kɔto bɛ mukoraati sintidua, nakoso me de, ɔngɔto me sintidua lle.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ‘kɔngɔen he, kora bɔ akɔ kɔbɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn nza kyɛ ɛnze me.’” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petro yele yenoa kyɛ: “Sɛ odikyɛ mene wɔ wu po a, mengɔha ye lle kyɛ menze wɔ.” Na sɔ ala yeɛ asuafoɛ bɔ baha ne koso hane ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ ɛberɛ Getsemane ne, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔtena wa kaa, mekɔ anyunu dɔ mekɔbɔ mbaeɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Na ɔfale Petro ne Sebedeo mmaa nyɔ ne bokale ye nwo so, na ye wora hyɛle yebo bɔle, na ne ye nwo teetee ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me wora abɔ pa-pa, ɔfa me kɔ ewue nu po. Ɛmɔtena ɛwa, na ɛmɔ ne me nwondɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ɔhɔle anyunu kaa ne, ɔfale ye nyunu butule berɛ, na ɔbɔle mbaeɛ kyɛ: “Me Baba, sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, ahaa ma kwangoa he sã me nwo. Nakoso, nná bɔ mekuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ, bɔ ɛkuro mmom yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Afei Yesu wale asuafoɛ nemɔ nwo berɛ, na onwuni kyɛ bala. Yeɛ obisale Petro kyɛ: “Yeti, ɛmɔ angora ne me anzi pɛ dɔnhwere kõ po? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ nwɛne”</char></note> na ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ, ná ɛmɔ angɔ nzɔhwɛ nu. Honhom ne de, okuro, nakoso nipadua ne yɛ mmerɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Osa hɔle ɔɔbɔle mbaeɛ ne bieku kyɛ: “Me Baba, sɛ kwangoa ne ngɔhora nngosa me nwo, na odikyɛ meno a, ye de, bɔ ekuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Na osa wale ne, né bala, ofikyɛ ne bɛ nye kõ paa. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yeti ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ hɔle, na ɔɔbɔle mbaeɛ bieku, ye pɛn nza so, na ɔhane edwirɛ komapɛ nala. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Na ɔwale asuafoɛ nemɔ nwo berɛ ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɔ mmerɛ he yeɛ ɛmɔda bedɛ ɛmɔ nwomeɛ ɔ? Ɛmɔnea, mmerɛ aso kyɛ bɛfa sona Awa ne bɛwura abɔnefoɛ sa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Ɛmɔ dwɔso ma yɛhɔ! Nea, bɔ ɔkɔye me kɔma ne adwu ɛwa ayie.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ogu so odwudwo ne, bɛkwaanea a, Yuda bɔ ɔboka buru-ne-nyɔ naso ne nyunu ɛhe, na né mmeni pee li ye si, bɔ bɛtire-tira dadeɛ ne mmo-kuro-mma. Sɔfo mbanyi ne kuro nanu mbanyi yeɛ né basoma bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Né bɔ ɔbaaye ye ma ne ali moa ama bɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bie kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ngɔfe ye noa ne, ye ane, ɛmɔhye ye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Yeti, ɔhɔle Yesu nwo berɛ tee, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Rabi, asomdwie ha wɔ!” Na ɔfele ye noa. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yeɛ Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Me damvo, w'amaneɛ wa?”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Me damvo, ɛpena nzu wa?”</char></note> Yeti mmenia nemɔ wale Yesu so, na bɛɛhyele ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, bɛ bɔ bɛboka Yesu so nanu kõ hwene ye dadeɛ hɔle sɔfo panyi ne akoaa naso, na ɔpɛle ye so kõ. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Fa wɔ dadeɛ ne wura ye boso. Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔtwe dadeɛ ne, dadeɛ noa yeɛ okowu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Anaa ɛnze kyɛ ngɔhora ngɔserɛ me Baba kyɛ ɔma me abɔfo pee<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Abɔfo asafo kue 12”</char></note> kesaalae? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ye de, ahaa ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne bɔ Tworɔnzɛm ne hane ne awa nu kyɛ, sɔ yeɛ odikyɛ ɔba ɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Sɔ mmerɛ nala, Yesu ha hyirele mmenia ne kyɛ: “Dadeɛ ne mmo-kuro-mma yeɛ ɛmɔ afa bawa me so, kyɛ ɛnwa ɛmɔ baahye awieniɛ ne? Daa biala, asɔre awuro berɛ yeɛ ne metena mekyirekyire ɔ, nakoso, ɛmɔ angye me. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Na ɛhe amukoraati asi, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, edwirɛ bɔ adiifoɛ ne hane ne kɔwa nu ɔ.” Yeɛ asuafoɛ namukoraati nwati yakyile ye ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bɛ bɔ bɛhyele Yesu ne fale ye hɔle Kaiafa berɛ, nekaa bɔ né atwerɛfoɛ ne maen nanu mbanyi nemɔ ayia ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Nakoso Petro de, olili ye si ngaka-ngaka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Wɔ siɛ paa”</char></note> oodwuli sɔfo panyi ne aluo berɛ. Na owurale nu ne, ɔɔtenane asomvoɛ nemɔ nu, kyɛ ɔnea bɔ okosi ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Afei, né sɔfo mbanyi ne Sanhendrin namukoraati pena edwirɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Pena adanzewia bie”</char></note> bie bɛto Yesu so, ná bagyina so bahu ye. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Nakoso, bannya bie. Ɔwɔ nu, mmeni pee wale bɛɛlili adanzeɛ betiale ye. Ye si ne, mmenia nyɔ bie wale, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />na bɛhane kyɛ: “Sɔ biaa he hane kyɛ, ‘Ngɔhora ngɔdwiri Nyameɛ asɔre awuro ne ngogua, na mafa ɛlɛsa masi.’” <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Yeti, sɔfo panyi ne dwɔsole, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Nzue yeɛ ɛle ye ka ɔ? Adanzeɛ beni yeɛ mmenia hemɔ di tia wɔ ne?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Nakoso, Yesu ammukye ye noa. Yeti, sɔfo panyi ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Mefa Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne meta ndaen megua wɔ so kyɛ, sɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne, Nyameɛ Awa ne a, ka kyire yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ye ala yeɛ aha ne. Nakoso, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, ɛmɔ konwu Sona Awa ne kyɛ ɔte Otumvoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Tumi” anaa “Bɔ ole Tumi”</char></note> ne sa famaa so, na ɔnate anwuro munungum nu ɔba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ɛhe maa sɔfo panyi né sunzuale ye atadeɛ nu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Wabɔ mmusue!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:65 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Waha mmusue dwirɛ”</char></note> Ye de, yɛpena adanzefoɛ bieku yɛyɛ nzu? Nea, nná ɛmɔ ate mmusue dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ sɛ?” Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Odikyɛ beku ye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Afei, bɛtetele ngɔserɛ bɛguale ye nyunu, na bɛbobɔle ye. Yeɛ ebiemɔ bobɔle ye nye so, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kristo, hyɛ ngɔm. Nwa yeɛ ɔbɔle wɔ ne?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Petro de, né ɔte aluo dɔ, yeɛ abaawa bie wale ye nwo berɛ, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, né ɛboka Galileaniɛ Yesu so.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Nakoso, ɔhane ye wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu kyɛ: “Menze bɔ ɛka nanwo hwee.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Ɔhɔle awuro né atee ne noa dɔ ne, abayaa foforɛ nwuni ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne kyɛ: “Né sɔ akoaa he boka Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu so.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Na ɔhane ndaen wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu kyɛ: “Menze biaa ne!” <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mmerɛ bie si ne, bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne wale Petro berɛ, na bɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛboka bɛ so, na wɔ dwudwolɛ po maa yɛnwu ye sɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Na ɛwa de, olili amoen hane ndaen kyɛ: “Menze biaa ne!” Na ɛberɛ ala, akɔ bɔle. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Yeɛ Petro kayele edwirɛ bɔ Yesu ha hyirele ye ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Kora bɔ akɔ kɔbɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn nza kyɛ ɛnze me.” Na ofitele oosuni paa.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Aleɛ hene ne, sɔfo mbanyi ne maen nanu mbanyi namukoraati yiale nu fale adwene bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhu Yesu ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bɛkyekyele ye, na bɛfale ye bɛɛwurale amrado Pilato sa. <verse eid="MAT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda bɔ ɔyele Yesu mane ne nwuni kyɛ babu ye kumfɔ ne, ɔyɛle ye yea paa, na osa fale dwetɛ aburasa ne ɔɔmane sɔfo mbanyi ne maen mbanyi nemɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Mayɛ bɔne paa kyɛ maye mogya bɔ odi bem mama ɛmɔ ɔ.” Bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, ɔfa yɛ nwo nzu? Ɔte wɔ bɔbɔ wɔ dwirɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yeti, Yuda gyile sikaa ne guale asɔre awuro berɛ, yeɛ ɔhɔle ɔ. Ná ɔɔbɔle ye kɔme. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ sesale sikaa ne, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, mmeraa mma ate kyɛ yɛfa yɛgua nekaa krongron bɔ bɛfa sikaa bɛgua ne, ofikyɛ, ɔte mogya sikaa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Yeti bɛdwenene ye nwo ne, bɛfa bɛɛtɔle aseɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aseɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛ nwo ngukuye”</char></note> bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkosie ɛwɔfoɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Yeti yeɛ bafrɛ ɛberɛ Mogya Aseɛ tonn maa waadwu ɛnɛ ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ɛhe maa edwirɛ bɔ diifoɛ Yeremia hane ne wale nu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:9">“Na bɛfale dwetɛ aburasa ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 27:9">nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛpɛ bɛtole ye so ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 27:9">bɔ Israel mmaa nemɔ bie pɛ tole ye so ne,<verse eid="MAT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />na bɛfa bɛtɔle aseɛ, <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nea 27:7 ne bo berɛ dwirɛ ne.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 27:10">Kyɛbɔ ne Awurade ahyɛ me ne.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yesu gyi amrado ne nyunu, na amrado ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Yudafoɛ Hene ne?” Yesu yele ye noa kyɛ: “Ye ala yeɛ aha ne.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Nakoso sɔfo mbanyi ne maen nanu mbanyi ne bɔ ye kwaadu ne, wandwudwo. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale ye kyɛ: “Yeti, edwirɛ nwora bɔ bɛka bɛgua wɔ so ne, ɛtelle?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Nakoso, Yesu ammukye ye noa; wanga edwirɛ komapɛ po. Ɛhe yɛle amrado ne nwanwa paa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Sɛ́ bɛdi afahyɛ biala a, né amrado ne yakyi bɛ bɔ bɛla prizin nanu kõ, sona biala bɔ mmenia ne pena kyɛ ɔyakyi ye ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ebie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Barabas la prizin, na ne wale dimmɔne paa. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Yeti mmenia nemɔ yiale ne, Pilato bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ nyakyi ye mma ɛmɔ ɔ, Barabas anaa Yesu bɔ ɛmɔnwa bɛfrɛ ye Kristo ne?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ofikyɛ né ɔse kyɛ ahoɔyaa ti yeɛ bafa Yesu babrɛ ye ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Afei koso, mmerɛ bɔ Pilato te atemmuo bia naso ne, ɔye somane maa bɛɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ye wɔ nwo fi teneneeniɛ he dwirɛ nanu, ofikyɛ ye ti, kɔngɔen he nwuni amaneɛ paa wɔ nnaleɛ nu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Nakoso, sɔfo mbanyi ne maen nanu mbanyi ne tutu guale mmenia nemɔ so anu kyɛ, bɛha kyɛ bɛkuro Barabas, na bɛma ohu Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Yeti, amrado ne bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Mmenia nyɔ he, bɛ nu beni yeɛ nyakyi ye mma ɛmɔ ɔ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Barabas!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale kyɛ: “Ye de, nzu yeɛ mva nyɛ Yesu, bɔ ɛmɔnwa bɛfrɛ ye Kristo ne?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati ɔ? Bɔne beni yeɛ wayɛ ɔ?” Nakoso bɛteɛteane nu kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Mmerɛ bɔ Pilato nwuni kyɛ, bɔ ɔyɛle ne anzi aga, mmom mmenia ne pena kyɛ bɛyɛ basabasa ne, ɔfale nzue nwuzini ye sa wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Menni biaa he mogya nwo fɔ. Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔyɛ ye bɔ ɛmɔ kuro biala.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mmenia namukoraati hane kyɛ: “Ye mogya gua yɛ, ne yɛ mmaa mɔ so.” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Yeti, ɔfale Barabas mane bɛ, nakoso ɔmaa bɛgwale Yesu, na ɔfale ye mane bɛ kyɛ, bɛɛbɔ ye asɛnnua nu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Yeɛ amrado né sogyafoɛ ne fale Yesu hɔle amrado ne awuro dɔ, na sogyafoɛ namukoraati pɛle ye nwo yiale. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bɛyele ye atadeɛ ne, na bɛfale ɛtena kɔkorɛ bie bɛhrale ye. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Yeɛ bɛfale mmowie bɛyɛle abotire bɛwurale ye, na bɛfale elemmire bɛwurale ye sa nu. Na bɛbule ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu bɛgorole ye nwo kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ hene, wɔ ngoa so oo!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bɛtetele ngɔserɛ bɛguale ye nyunu, na bɛlɛle elemmire ne bɛfili ye sa nu bɛfa bɛfifini ye tia nu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Bɛgorole ye nwo bɛyiele ne, bɛyele ɛtena ne, na besa bɛfale ye bɔbɔ ye atadeɛ ne bɛwurale ye. Na bɛfale ye bɛhɔle kyɛ bɛkwaabɔ ye asɛnnua nu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Bɛfite bɛkɔ ne, bɛnwuni Kireniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ Simon. Bɛhyɛle sɔ biaa ne maa ɔsoale Yesu asɛnnua ne. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Na bɛdwuli nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ <char style="tl">Golgota</char>, bɔ okyire “Tire Kokuroka” ne, <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />bɛfale abɔwee bɛfrale nzãa bɛmane ye kyɛ ɔno, nakoso ɔhane ye noa ne, wanno. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu bɛyiele ne, bɛtɔɔsole<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔle ndondo.”</char></note> bɛhyɛle ye atadeɛ nanu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Na bɛtenane berɛ bɛneane ye so. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Afei, bɛhworɔle ye kwaadu ne bɛbɔle ye ti afia kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">YESU,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">YUDAFOƐ HENE NE.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Bɛbɔle awiefoɛ nyɔ asɛnnua nu bɛbokale ye so, né kõ wɔ ye bɛen, yeɛ né kõ wɔ ye famaa. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛpɛ nu berɛ ne dwudwo tiale ye, na bɛwosole bɛ ti <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />bɛhane kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ enwa ɛkodwiri asɔre awuro ne kogua, na afa ɛlɛsa asi ne, ye de, dɛ́ wɔ nwo ee! Sɛ ɛte Nyameɛ awa a, fi asɛnnua naso dwu ase.” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ sɔfo mbanyi, atwerɛfoɛ, ne maen nanu mbanyi ne koso hyɛle yebo gorole ye nwo kyɛ: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Odɛ́ amanvoɛ, nakoso ɔngora nne ye nwo. Ɔte Israelfoɛ Hene, ma odwu fi asɛnnua naso, na yɛkole ye yɛkoli. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Wafa ye nwo wato Nyameɛ so, sɛ okuro ye dwirɛ a, ma ole ye, ofikyɛ né ɔka kyɛ, ‘Nde Nyameɛ Awa.’” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Na awiefoɛ bɔ babɔ bɛ asɛnnua nu baboka ye so ne koso pepɛle ye nzoaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ná ofi eyia 12:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ekyire yebo tee a, ɔte: “Dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia.”</char></note> bɔ ɔkɔ ne, aseɛ naso yɛle tumm tonn oodwuli eyia 3:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ekyire yebo tee a, ɔte: “Dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona.”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ɔbɔle kɔyɛ kyɛ 3:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nea 27:45 ne bo berɛ dwirɛ ne.</char></note> ne, Yesu teane nu kyɛ: <char style="tl">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?”</char> Yebo kyire kyɛ: “Me Nyameɛ, Me Nyameɛ, nzuati yeɛ aye wɔ nye ama me ne?” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne bie tele ɛhe ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɔfrɛ Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Bɛ nu kõ tuli mirika ɔɔfale eminaen, na ɔfa bɔle nzãa bɔ enu ka nu, yeɛ ɔfa tuale elemmire noa fa mane ye kyɛ ɔno. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Nakoso, bɛ ngaa ne hane kyɛ: “Yakyi ye! Ma yɛnea sɛ Elia koolɛ́ ye a.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yesu sa teane nu bieku, na oyakyile ye honhom nu. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Na nea, <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> bɔ ɔwɔ nekaa krongron berɛ nanu tele nyɔ fili anwuro oosili ase, aseɛ wosole, na nyɔboɛ mɔ nu pakye-pakyele. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Asieleɛ mɔ so bukye-bukyele, na akrongronfoɛ bɔ bawuwu<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Badeda.”</char></note> nemɔ fuin ne fitele, <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />na mmeni pee nwuni fuin nemɔ. (Otingye fili ewue nu ne, bɛ bɔ bɛhɔle asieleɛ naso berɛ ne hɔle kuro krongron nanu.) <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Sogyaniɛ panyi ne né bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so, bɔ né bɛnea Yesu so ne nwuni aseɛ wosolɛ ne, ɔne nningyein bɔ osisile namukoraati ne, esuronyi hane bɛ, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Ampa, ɛhe yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Né mmrasua pee gyi nekaa bie bɛnea bɔ ɔkɔ so ne. Né bali Yesu si bafi Galilea, bɛ yeɛ ne bɛsõ ye ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Bɛ nu bie yeɛ ole Mary Magdalene, Yakobo ne Yosef maame Mary, ɔne Sebedeo mmaa nemɔ maame.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, sikaniɛ bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yosef bɔ ofi Arimatea wale berɛ, né ɔte Yesu suaniɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ɔhɔle Pilato berɛ ɔɔsrɛle Yesu fuin ne, na Pilato hane kyɛ bɛfa bɛma ye. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosef fale fuin ne, na ɔfale nwera kama-kama kyekyele ye nwo, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />na ɔfa tole ye bɔbɔ ye asieleɛ bɔ watu ye foforɛ wɔ nyɔboɛ bie nu. Mmerɛ bɔ ɔfale nyɔboɛ kandinga bie tole bɔen ne noa ne, oyakyile ye berɛ hɔle. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Nakoso, Mary Magdalene, ne Mary kõ ne de, bɛhale berɛ, né bɛte asieleɛ ne nyunu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Kyẽa bɔ oli Anwoboaboa kyẽa ne si ne, sɔfo mbanyi ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ hɔle Pilato berɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛ wura, yɛkaye kyɛ, ngondomboniɛ ne te ase ne, ɔhane kyɛ, ‘Ɛlɛsa si ne, ngotingye.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Yeti, ma bɛɛbɔ asieleɛ nanwo waen ma oodwu ye lɛsa naso. Wanyɛ sɔ a, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ koowia ye, ná baaha bahyire yɛ kyɛ watingye. Ye de, ahaa ngondombo bɔ yesi ne ɔkɔwa ne, ɔkɔtra daa deɛ ne.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle sogyafoɛ, ɛmɔma bɛɛbɔ asieleɛ nanwo waen, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ kɔhora ɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Yeti bɛhɔle, na bɛfale nikye bɛɛtale nyɔboɛ ne si serɛ-serɛ, na bɛmaa sogyafoɛ nemɔ neane berɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Homeda ne si, dapɛn nanu kyẽa bɔ oli moa né alobahene ne, Mary Magdalene ne Mary kõhene wale asieleɛ naso. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Na aseɛ ne wosole serɛ-serɛ, ofikyɛ ne Awurade bɔfo adwu afi anwuro waaye nyɔboɛ ne wafi berɛ, na né ɔte so. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Né ɔbɔfo ne ta hyireinn te kyɛ agralaa bɔ wate yerɛm ne, na né ye atadeɛ te fufue hyɛnn te kyɛ asukɔtwea. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Ye nwo suronyi ti, sogyafoɛ nemɔ nwo woso-wosole bɛ, na bɛyɛle kyɛ ebie bɔ wawu ne. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Nakoso, abɔfo ne ha hyirele mmrasua nemɔ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ maa esuronyi ka ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ mese kyɛ ɛmɔpena Yesu, bɔ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu ne. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ɔnne wa, ofikyɛ batingye ye, kyɛbɔ ɔhane nala. Ɛmɔbra, ɛmɔɔnea nekaa bɔ ne ɔla ne. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Yeti ɛmɔha ɛmɔ nwo, na ɛmɔɔbɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ amaneɛ kyɛ batingye ye. Na odi ɛmɔ nyunu moa kɔ Galilea. Ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ konwu ye ɔ. Ɛmɔnea, maha mahyire ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Yeti, bɛyɛle ndɛ bɛfili asieleɛ naso, na bɛfale esuronyi ne anigye bɛtuli mirika kyɛ bɛkwaabɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ amaneɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Na mvum nu, Yesu yiale bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ!” Yeti, bɛhɔle ye nwo berɛ bɛɛsɔle ye gya nu bɛkotole ye. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ suro, ɛmɔhɔ bɛɛbɔ nniema nemɔ amaneɛ kyɛ, bɛhɔ Galilea, na bɛkonwu me wɔ berɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Bɛnate atee so bɛkɔ ne, sogyafoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Awɛnvoɛ”</char></note> nemɔ bie hɔle kuro nanu, na bɛɛhane bɔ wasi namukoraati bɛhyirele sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Na sɔfo mbanyi ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne yiale nu bɔle porɛ ne, bɛmane sogyafoɛ nemɔ sikaa kandinga, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />na bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔha kyɛ, ‘Kɔngɔen bɔ yɛlale ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale berɛ bɛɛwiale ye.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na sɛ amrado ne te a, yɛ ne ye kodwudwo, yeti nnɛmaa ɔha ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Yeti, sogyafoɛ ne lɛle sikaa ne, na bɛyɛle bɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ ne. Ná sɔ dwirɛ ne atrɛ wɔ Yudafoɛ nu waadwu ɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Nakoso 11 ne hɔle Galilea, bɛhɔle bokaa bɔ ne Yesu aha ahyire bɛ kyɛ beeyia ye wɔ so naso. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Bɛnwuni ye ne, bɛkotole ye, nakoso, né ebiemɔ nne nni. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yeɛ Yesu wale bɛ nwo berɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bafa anwuro ne aseɛ so tumi mukoraati bama me, <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Yeti, ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔɔyɛ maen mukoraati m'asuafoɛ, ɛmɔbɔ bɛ asu wɔ Baba ne, Baa ne, ɔne honhom krongron ne dumaa nu, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />na ɛmɔ hyirehyire bɛ maa bɛli bɔ mahyɛ ɛmɔ namukoraati so. Nea, mmoka ɛmɔ so daa biala, kodwu kyɛ wiase né awieɛ kɔwa ɔ.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>